<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:07.000" end="00:00:10.300" style="s2">Mrs. Hayes, take a good look at your new</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.200" end="00:00:11.700" style="s2">mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.300" end="00:00:13.400" style="s2">From now on, you and your mute little</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.700" end="00:00:16.000" style="s2">brat rot out here.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.400" end="00:00:17.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bastard. My husband trusted you more</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.000" end="00:00:19.300" style="s2">than anyone. He&#39;s barely cold in the</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.900" end="00:00:20.400" style="s2">ground and you&#39;re stealing everything he</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.300" end="00:00:23.600" style="s2">had?</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.400" end="00:00:23.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t forget our little wager.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.100" end="00:00:34.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clayton, this is my home. What the hell</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.700" end="00:00:36.700" style="s2">do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.900" end="00:00:38.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband&#39;s dead, Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.700" end="00:00:40.500" style="s2">but he still owed me a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.800" end="00:00:42.700" style="s2">This house and everything in it belong</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.500" end="00:00:44.500" style="s2">to me now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.700" end="00:00:46.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That handwriting&#39;s a mess.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.500" end="00:00:48.700" style="s2">Liam never signed this willingly.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.500" end="00:00:50.600" style="s2">It&#39;s a forgery. Liam&#39;s company made</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.700" end="00:00:53.800" style="s2">millions every year. HE WOULDN&#39;T LEAVE</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.600" end="00:00:53.800" style="s2">US WITHOUT A SINGLE CENT.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.000" end="00:00:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Legal papers and recordings don&#39;t lie.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.600" end="00:01:00.600" style="s2">You have nothing to do with this place</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.700" end="00:01:02.900" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.600" end="00:01:05.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I don&#39;t believe it. I&#39;ll have a</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.900" end="00:01:08.000" style="s2">judge look into this.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.700" end="00:01:09.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think about your son, Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.000" end="00:01:11.800" style="s2">Making a scene won&#39;t do either of you</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.300" end="00:01:11.800" style="s2">any good.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.900" end="00:01:15.500" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.300" end="00:01:17.600" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you one chance. Earn $10</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.500" end="00:01:19.600" style="s2">million at Silver Creek Farm within a</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.600" end="00:01:21.800" style="s2">year, and every asset your husband</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">mortgaged comes back to you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.800" end="00:01:27.200" style="s2">Otherwise, this house is mine and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.200" end="00:01:29.200" style="s2">a million dollars in debt.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.200" end="00:01:30.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $10 million?</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.200" end="00:01:32.900" style="s2">How am I How could I ever</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.900" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it or you and your precious boy</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.900" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">sleep on the street tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.500" end="00:01:44.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I swear it. Everything that was my</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.600" end="00:01:45.200" style="s2">husband&#39;s, I will take it all back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.801" end="00:01:47.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.200" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it back? First see if you can</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.000" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">survive this hellhole.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.661" end="00:01:54.681" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.000" end="00:01:57.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, baby, don&#39;t be scared. It&#39;s just a</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.600" end="00:01:59.100" style="s2">game.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.800" end="00:02:02.092" style="s2">Trust mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.100" end="00:02:02.092" style="s2">Everything&#39;s to be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.092" end="00:02:12.792" style="s2">It&#39;ll get better. We&#39;re going to make</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.492" end="00:02:12.792" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.861" end="00:02:20.881" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.092" end="00:02:23.792" style="s2">What&#39;s down here?</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.092" end="00:02:47.892" style="s2">Who Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.992" end="00:02:51.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In hundreds of years, you&#39;re the first</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.292" end="00:02:55.192" style="s2">to wake me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.992" end="00:02:57.292" style="s2">By the rules, you get three wishes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.192" end="00:02:58.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re You&#39;re a genie?</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.292" end="00:03:01.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can call [snorts] me that, though I</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.692" end="00:03:01.692" style="s2">prefer the lamp.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.492" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really get three wishes? Anything at</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.392" end="00:03:08.392" style="s2">all?</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:08.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say them first. Let&#39;s hear it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.092" end="00:03:12.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I bring my husband back?</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.392" end="00:03:15.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Life and death are beyond me. Pick</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.192" end="00:03:16.892" style="s2">another.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.847" end="00:03:18.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.892" end="00:03:20.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then destroy Clayton. Make him cough up</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.892" end="00:03:22.592" style="s2">everything he swallowed.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.192" end="00:03:24.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One, no taking or harming human life.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.592" end="00:03:26.892" style="s2">Two, no conjuring money.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.492" end="00:03:29.092" style="s2">Three, no messing with people&#39;s minds.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.892" end="00:03:31.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not this, not that. Fine. Make me the</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.092" end="00:03:34.092" style="s2">greatest farmer alive so I can take back</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.392" end="00:03:34.092" style="s2">what&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.192" end="00:03:38.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal. Magic spring water. One refill</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.992" end="00:03:40.092" style="s2">every midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.292" end="00:03:44.092" style="s2">Pour it straight on your farm.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.092" end="00:03:44.092" style="s2">And remember, two wishes left.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.992" end="00:03:56.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liam, please watch over us.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.392" end="00:03:56.192" style="s2">Silas and I really need a miracle.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.092" end="00:04:06.094" style="s2">Oh my god, am I dreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.394" end="00:04:17.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks decent. Let&#39;s see how it tastes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.194" end="00:04:20.494" style="s2">I&#39;ve already sunk this low. What&#39;s left</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.694" end="00:04:20.494" style="s2">to be afraid of?</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.094" end="00:04:25.494" style="s2">God,</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.094" end="00:04:26.994" style="s2">this flavor.</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.494" end="00:04:29.194" style="s2">I never tasted anything like this in the</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.994" end="00:04:31.094" style="s2">finest stores.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.194" end="00:04:32.094" style="s2">Baby, a miracle. This fruit tastes like</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.094" end="00:04:35.894" style="s2">heaven.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.094" end="00:04:35.894" style="s2">Maybe our bet has a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.094" end="00:04:50.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fresh fruit, sweet and juicy. Come take</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.094" end="00:04:50.594" style="s2">a look.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.494" end="00:04:57.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, hello there, pretty lady. Never</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.594" end="00:05:00.794" style="s2">seen you around here before.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.094" end="00:05:00.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me. Stay away from us.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.194" end="00:05:06.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.494" end="00:05:08.194" style="s2">Set up a stall on my turf, you pay me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.894" end="00:05:10.494" style="s2">Protection fee.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.194" end="00:05:13.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Protection fee? I don&#39;t have money and</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.494" end="00:05:13.494" style="s2">I&#39;m not giving you a cent.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.094" end="00:05:19.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No money?</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.794" end="00:05:19.894" style="s2">Then pay me with yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.294" end="00:05:28.994" style="s2">YOU LITTLE BASTARD, YOU HIT ME.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.594" end="00:05:28.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, DON&#39;T TOUCH MY SON.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.294" end="00:05:34.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BUBBA, TAKE YOUR LITTLE troop and get</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.094" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">lost.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.494" end="00:05:37.194" style="s2">Or that thing in your pants is gone for</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.094" end="00:05:40.394" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.194" end="00:05:40.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucky day, lady. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.494" end="00:05:45.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.594" end="00:05:47.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.794" end="00:05:48.194" style="s2">Those thugs are always causing trouble</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.294" end="00:05:49.594" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.194" end="00:05:51.994" style="s2">You&#39;re the lady who moved into Silver</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.594" end="00:05:53.994" style="s2">Creek Farm, right? I&#39;m Mara Bennett.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.994" end="00:05:55.994" style="s2">We&#39;re neighbors.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.994" end="00:05:58.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Elena. It&#39;s my first day selling at</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.994" end="00:05:58.494" style="s2">the market.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.494" end="00:06:02.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These look incredible. Let me help you</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.094" end="00:06:06.295" style="s2">shout.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.094" end="00:06:06.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweet tomatoes, come get a taste.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.095" end="00:06:11.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm, price isn&#39;t bad. Give me one to try.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.695" end="00:06:19.695" style="s2">Lord above, are you kidding me? Best</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.095" end="00:06:19.695" style="s2">tomato I&#39;ve ever had in my life.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.595" end="00:06:27.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sold out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.795" end="00:06:29.895" style="s2">Silas, we made our first money.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.895" end="00:06:32.495" style="s2">I need to buy more seeds. This is our</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.895" end="00:06:32.495" style="s2">new beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.195" end="00:06:38.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, I checked. She lives at Silver</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.895" end="00:06:40.095" style="s2">Creek Farm. No man in the house, just</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.995" end="00:06:42.495" style="s2">her and one little brat.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.095" end="00:06:45.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. She hit me. Time that woman</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.495" end="00:06:45.895" style="s2">learned what pain tastes like.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.295" end="00:06:50.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 20 packs each of grape, blackberry, and</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.695" end="00:06:52.195" style="s2">rainbow carrot seeds.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.295" end="00:06:54.495" style="s2">Can you deliver to my farm later?</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.195" end="00:06:57.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure thing. What&#39;s the address?</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.495" end="00:06:57.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silver Creek Farm.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.495" end="00:07:04.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silver Creek? You joking? That ground&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.395" end="00:07:06.895" style="s2">pure salt. Seedlings die in 3 days out</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.895" end="00:07:09.595" style="s2">there. I don&#39;t do refunds, so don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.895" end="00:07:09.595" style="s2">crying back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.684" end="00:07:11.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.795" end="00:07:13.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, I won&#39;t bother you. Just deliver</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.695" end="00:07:14.495" style="s2">on time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.295" end="00:07:16.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.495" end="00:07:18.895" style="s2">I&#39;d love to see what grows on that dead</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.095" end="00:07:18.895" style="s2">land of yours.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.595" end="00:07:25.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, this is jam I made myself. A small</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.895" end="00:07:25.695" style="s2">thank you for helping me at the market.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.405" end="00:07:27.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.695" end="00:07:28.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, smells amazing. You&#39;re really</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.695" end="00:07:30.195" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.895" end="00:07:32.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, where can I find a reliable</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.195" end="00:07:33.795" style="s2">handyman? I need to fix my roof.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.610" end="00:07:35.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.795" end="00:07:37.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband Joe is the best mason in the</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.395" end="00:07:39.395" style="s2">county. I&#39;ll send him over.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.395" end="00:07:40.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, thank you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.395" end="00:07:43.395" style="s2">Once I&#39;m making money, I&#39;ll repay you</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.795" end="00:07:43.395" style="s2">properly.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.295" end="00:07:57.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, Elena. Since when did these</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.395" end="00:07:58.895" style="s2">flowers grow on your walls? This is</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.895" end="00:08:00.395" style="s2">unreal.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.895" end="00:08:01.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve been there all along. You just</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.395" end="00:08:04.395" style="s2">never looked.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.995" end="00:08:05.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This boy, is he always like this? He</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.395" end="00:08:08.097" style="s2">barely talks.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.895" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He He his father die in that car crash.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.097" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">Since then he shut himself away.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.397" end="00:08:14.097" style="s2">It&#39;ll get better.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.797" end="00:08:19.997" style="s2">But this place gives me the creeps. You</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.897" end="00:08:21.797" style="s2">really plan to live out here for good?</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.997" end="00:08:24.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love it here. I have a feeling it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.797" end="00:08:24.797" style="s2">going to change my life.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.397" end="00:08:28.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, here are your seeds. Where do you</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.697" end="00:08:30.997" style="s2">want them?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.397" end="00:08:30.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just put them here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.397" end="00:08:38.097" style="s2">You knew Silver Creek is salt flats and</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.297" end="00:08:41.097" style="s2">you still sold her all those seeds?</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.097" end="00:08:41.097" style="s2">That&#39;s a scam.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.097" end="00:08:47.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, don&#39;t blame him. I bought the</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.297" end="00:08:47.297" style="s2">seeds on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.697" end="00:08:52.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, listen to me. Silver Creek soil</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.997" end="00:08:54.697" style="s2">is dead. It&#39;s been abandoned 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.697" end="00:08:56.597" style="s2">Return the seeds before you open them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.697" end="00:08:58.097" style="s2">Don&#39;t waste your money.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.597" end="00:09:00.597" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.097" end="00:09:00.597" style="s2">I have a way.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.397" end="00:09:07.197" style="s2">Baby, I know everything here feels</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.897" end="00:09:08.797" style="s2">strange,</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.197" end="00:09:11.897" style="s2">but it&#39;ll get better.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.797" end="00:09:11.897" style="s2">Mommy&#39;s not lying to you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.797" end="00:09:16.997" style="s2">Hey handsome, want to see some real</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.597" end="00:09:16.997" style="s2">magic?</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.997" end="00:09:30.497" style="s2">See that, Silas?</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.597" end="00:09:32.497" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s still here, up in the sky</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.497" end="00:09:33.897" style="s2">watching over us. But it&#39;s our little</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.497" end="00:09:37.197" style="s2">secret.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.897" end="00:09:37.197" style="s2">Not a word to anyone, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.336" end="00:09:42.356" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.497" end="00:09:45.997" style="s2">Thank God.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.297" end="00:09:49.097" style="s2">Since Liam left us, I thought I&#39;d never</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.997" end="00:09:49.097" style="s2">see him smile again.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.497" end="00:09:55.997" style="s2">At this rate, they&#39;ll all be ripe in 3</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.997" end="00:09:58.397" style="s2">days, just in time for the weekend</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.997" end="00:09:58.397" style="s2">market.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.297" end="00:10:05.597" style="s2">Silas?</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.597" end="00:10:05.597" style="s2">Silas, where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.497" end="00:10:14.198" style="s2">Blood.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.898" end="00:10:14.198" style="s2">Silas?</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.982" end="00:10:21.002" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.498" end="00:10:29.398" style="s2">Just a stray puppy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.998" end="00:10:35.598" style="s2">Wonder if this stuff works on animals.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.098" end="00:10:35.598" style="s2">Let&#39;s try.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.598" end="00:10:40.398" style="s2">So the magic water only works on plants.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.298" end="00:10:46.898" style="s2">The little guy needs a name. What should</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.998" end="00:10:46.898" style="s2">we call him, Silas?</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.498" end="00:11:06.898" style="s2">Hey Mara, something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.998" end="00:11:12.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get me started. The bugs this year</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.298" end="00:11:15.398" style="s2">are a disaster. They ate every last</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.498" end="00:11:16.898" style="s2">vegetable. Whole season wasted.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.398" end="00:11:19.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I mixed up some organic bug spray. Want</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.898" end="00:11:19.298" style="s2">to try it?</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.198" end="00:11:30.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God. Elena, what kind of magic recipe is</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.898" end="00:11:31.898" style="s2">this? Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.598" end="00:11:34.298" style="s2">You have to come to the town market</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.898" end="00:11:36.398" style="s2">tomorrow. Maybe you&#39;ll run into an ag</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.298" end="00:11:37.298" style="s2">professor who can fix that salt soil for</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.398" end="00:11:39.298" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.298" end="00:11:41.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, forget the professor. My land&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.298" end="00:11:44.298" style="s2">already growing treasure.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.998" end="00:11:47.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop bragging. Grass growing on that</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.298" end="00:11:47.498" style="s2">wreck would be a miracle.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.398" end="00:11:59.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This How is this possible? Is this</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.698" end="00:12:01.698" style="s2">really Silver Creek Farm?</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.698" end="00:12:04.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last year I noticed the soil changing,</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.698" end="00:12:05.398" style="s2">so I quietly fixed it up. Didn&#39;t expect</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.098" end="00:12:07.898" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.398" end="00:12:09.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.898" end="00:12:11.498" style="s2">You&#39;re incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.998" end="00:12:13.399" style="s2">I&#39;ll get Joe to bring the truck right</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.498" end="00:12:15.999" style="s2">now. We&#39;ll harvest it all tonight for</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.399" end="00:12:15.999" style="s2">the market.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.099" end="00:12:22.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silas, come on. We&#39;re going to the</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.799" end="00:12:22.799" style="s2">market today.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.099" end="00:12:26.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.599" end="00:12:34.599" style="s2">I grew up in the city. I&#39;ve never seen a</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.599" end="00:12:34.599" style="s2">market this lively.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.399" end="00:12:44.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, we&#39;ve got other stops. Good luck</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.299" end="00:12:48.599" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.899" end="00:12:48.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See you tomorrow, Silas.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.799" end="00:12:55.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fresh organic fruit, pure, clean, no</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.999" end="00:12:58.699" style="s2">chemicals. Come taste.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.399" end="00:12:58.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.799" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">If it isn&#39;t the pretty little widow down</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.599" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">on her luck.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.699" end="00:13:07.599" style="s2">Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.999" end="00:13:08.999" style="s2">dragging a mute kid around all alone</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.599" end="00:13:10.699" style="s2">must be rough.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.999" end="00:13:13.099" style="s2">Why not come with me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.699" end="00:13:17.499" style="s2">I&#39;ll take real good care of you both.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.099" end="00:13:17.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t even know you. Get away from us.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.199" end="00:13:23.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.599" end="00:13:26.499" style="s2">You hit me? Boss, there&#39;s a cop</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.999" end="00:13:26.499" style="s2">patrolling.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.599" end="00:13:29.699" style="s2">I think he&#39;s watching us.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.799" end="00:13:36.499" style="s2">Everyone, look. What kind of garbage</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.599" end="00:13:38.499" style="s2">fruit is this? Taste like dirt.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.499" end="00:13:41.999" style="s2">Nothing good grows on that dead land.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:43.899" style="s2">Don&#39;t let this scammer fool you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.999" end="00:13:45.699" style="s2">Silver Creek Farm, nothing&#39;s grown there</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.899" end="00:13:47.399" style="s2">in 10 years. It&#39;s a gimmick.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.699" end="00:13:50.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fruit that pretty can&#39;t come from there.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.399" end="00:13:51.399" style="s2">She bought it somewhere and lied to us.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:53.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.399" end="00:13:55.999" style="s2">a woman with a mute kid,</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.099" end="00:13:59.064" style="s2">you&#39;ll never survive here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.999" end="00:14:01.084" style="s2">When you change your mind, COME BEG ME.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.064" end="00:14:01.084" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.599" end="00:14:13.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SILAS,</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.199" end="00:14:13.999" style="s2">MOMMY&#39;S FINE.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.299" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S HER.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:23.801" style="s2">There you are. I took those tomatoes and</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.201" end="00:14:25.801" style="s2">blueberries home and shared them with</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.801" end="00:14:27.601" style="s2">the neighbors. They can&#39;t stop talking</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.801" end="00:14:28.201" style="s2">about them. Everyone&#39;s been waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.601" end="00:14:29.801" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.201" end="00:14:31.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? You mean</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.801" end="00:14:33.301" style="s2">you&#39;re here to buy?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.201" end="00:14:35.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Hurry everyone before it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.301" end="00:14:35.901" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.301" end="00:14:41.601" style="s2">My god.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.701" end="00:14:43.801" style="s2">This taste it could steal your soul.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.601" end="00:14:48.001" style="s2">Best blackberry of my life.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.801" end="00:14:48.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t take mine. I&#39;m buying two baskets.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.201" end="00:14:54.201" style="s2">This impossible. This really grew at</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.901" end="00:14:57.701" style="s2">Silver Creek Farm?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.201" end="00:14:57.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shopkeeper, want a carrot to try?</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.701" end="00:15:06.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Son, what good could come out of a</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.001" end="00:15:06.801" style="s2">country market? I&#39;m not wasting my time.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.201" end="00:15:18.101" style="s2">This texture,</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.501" end="00:15:20.701" style="s2">this sweetness, unreal. This is Michelin</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.101" end="00:15:22.501" style="s2">star organic produce. Ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.701" end="00:15:24.401" style="s2">I&#39;ll hold back. I&#39;ll take every last one</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.501" end="00:15:26.201" style="s2">of these. Here&#39;s my card. I&#39;m head of</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.401" end="00:15:28.701" style="s2">purchasing for Blue Ocean Hotel. You</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.201" end="00:15:30.001" style="s2">supply, we buy. Exclusive, top price,</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.701" end="00:15:33.101" style="s2">long-term.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.001" end="00:15:35.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Business just walked up to my stall?</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.101" end="00:15:37.801" style="s2">Yes, Mr. Miller.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.801" end="00:15:40.401" style="s2">This is a huge deal. We&#39;re getting</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.801" end="00:15:40.401" style="s2">closer.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.301" end="00:15:45.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.701" end="00:15:47.401" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t she crash and burn? Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.501" end="00:15:50.301" style="s2">Tonight we go as planned. I want her on</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.401" end="00:15:50.301" style="s2">her knees begging.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.001" end="00:15:55.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And they lived happily ever after.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.206" end="00:16:04.226" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.501" end="00:16:15.101" style="s2">Today is only the start.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.101" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">To win the bet in a year,</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.101" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">I have to scale</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.902" end="00:16:28.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, it&#39;s open.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.302" end="00:16:31.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In. Listen up. One of you grabs the</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.702" end="00:16:32.602" style="s2">cash, one holds the mute kid. As for the</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.502" end="00:16:35.802" style="s2">woman,</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.602" end="00:16:35.802" style="s2">she&#39;s mine to enjoy.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.702" end="00:16:48.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You damn [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.402" end="00:16:50.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I have to get that thing.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.302" end="00:16:52.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, lady. Single mother out on the</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.302" end="00:16:55.602" style="s2">flats with a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.002" end="00:16:55.602" style="s2">Cops take half an hour to get here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.202" end="00:16:59.802" style="s2">You need something to protect yourself,</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.502" end="00:16:59.802" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.602" end="00:17:09.902" style="s2">Run. Keep running.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.102" end="00:17:12.902" style="s2">Out here you can scream your throat out.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.902" end="00:17:12.902" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.002" end="00:17:20.702" style="s2">Hey, easy, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.002" end="00:17:22.302" style="s2">Gun might go off.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.702" end="00:17:24.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.302" end="00:17:27.602" style="s2">Get out of my house right now</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.402" end="00:17:27.602" style="s2">or I&#39;ll blow your head off.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.667" end="00:17:30.687" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.602" end="00:17:37.002" style="s2">Silas, Mochi.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.602" end="00:17:44.902" style="s2">Baba, please. The money&#39;s on my bedroom</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.002" end="00:17:47.402" style="s2">table. Take all of it. Just let my son</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.902" end="00:17:47.402" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.702" end="00:17:51.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.002" end="00:17:55.402" style="s2">look what I found in the locked chest in</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.402" end="00:17:55.402" style="s2">her room. This thing is glowing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.102" end="00:18:03.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A broke widow keeps cash lying around</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.902" end="00:18:04.902" style="s2">but locks up this</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.702" end="00:18:07.502" style="s2">talk.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.902" end="00:18:07.502" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.502" end="00:18:13.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.502" end="00:18:17.202" style="s2">It&#39;s just plant food I bought in town. I</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.002" end="00:18:19.202" style="s2">I added some glow dye. It&#39;s worthless.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.202" end="00:18:21.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;m stupid?</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.202" end="00:18:23.603" style="s2">Lie again and you&#39;ll regret</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.103" end="00:18:25.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t shoot. I&#39;ll talk. I&#39;ll tell you</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.603" end="00:18:27.803" style="s2">everything. Magic growth serum.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.903" end="00:18:32.103" style="s2">Nothing&#39;s grown at Silver Creek in 10</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.803" end="00:18:33.903" style="s2">years. This is how I grew that fruit.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.103" end="00:18:36.903" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you the formula.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.903" end="00:18:36.903" style="s2">Just let us go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.003" end="00:18:42.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, even Blue Ocean was fighting over</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.303" end="00:18:44.503" style="s2">her fruit. With this formula, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.703" end="00:18:47.803" style="s2">rich.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.503" end="00:18:50.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the formula? Hand it over now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.803" end="00:18:51.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me back Silas. Let him go or you</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.103" end="00:18:55.603" style="s2">get nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.403" end="00:18:55.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let the brat go. They can&#39;t run anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.803" end="00:19:03.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The formula&#39;s hidden in the old barn out</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.403" end="00:19:06.103" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.503" end="00:19:06.103" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.203" end="00:19:18.903" style="s2">Elena Hayes, it&#39;s under the barn floor.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.203" end="00:19:18.903" style="s2">This is our only chance to live.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.703" end="00:19:24.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No tricks.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.103" end="00:19:24.103" style="s2">Get the formula.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.003" end="00:19:34.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Possess my caution.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.803" end="00:19:35.903" style="s2">Genie, come out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.203" end="00:19:38.403" style="s2">I make my second wish.</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.903" end="00:19:42.103" style="s2">Give me two utterly loyal, superhumanly</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.403" end="00:19:42.103" style="s2">strong helpers now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.803" end="00:19:49.103" style="s2">How?</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.403" end="00:19:54.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unicorn Bowman,</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.903" end="00:19:55.603" style="s2">you [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.203" end="00:19:59.003" style="s2">You think you can play me with scrap</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.603" end="00:19:59.003" style="s2">metal? YOU&#39;RE DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.203" end="00:20:05.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY, THE POLE.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.903" end="00:20:05.403" style="s2">MOMMY, RUN.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.303" end="00:20:14.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What what the hell is this? A monster?</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.303" end="00:20:14.403" style="s2">LET THE BOSS GO.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.703" end="00:20:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY, LOOK. IT&#39;S Iron Man.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.003" end="00:20:24.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silas, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.605" end="00:20:28.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; safe.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.505" end="00:20:30.905" style="s2">Baby, say it again. Call me mommy again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.105" end="00:20:33.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I&#39;m not scared anymore. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.905" end="00:20:33.905" style="s2">protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.005" end="00:20:40.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prime directive confirmed. Awaiting your</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.505" end="00:20:44.005" style="s2">orders, master. Second wish delivered.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.005" end="00:20:44.005" style="s2">Don&#39;t wake me for petty thieves again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.705" end="00:20:54.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheriff, I&#39;m not lying. She&#39;s got two</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.305" end="00:20:56.905" style="s2">flying tin monsters, 6 ft tall, and a</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.105" end="00:20:59.305" style="s2">jug of magic water that glows green. Go</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.905" end="00:21:00.605" style="s2">search the place. Yes, yes. It shoots</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.305" end="00:21:02.005" style="s2">gold light.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.605" end="00:21:04.005" style="s2">Terrifying.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.005" end="00:21:06.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s morning. These three idiots are</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.005" end="00:21:09.005" style="s2">hallucinating. Take them in and let them</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.205" end="00:21:09.005" style="s2">sober up.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.205" end="00:21:14.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheriff, they were probably spooked by</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.205" end="00:21:15.905" style="s2">these two high-end farm robots I just</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.105" end="00:21:18.405" style="s2">bought. They have a night security</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.905" end="00:21:19.605" style="s2">capture mode.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.405" end="00:21:22.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.605" end="00:21:24.305" style="s2">So it&#39;s the new high-tech farm gear.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.305" end="00:21:26.005" style="s2">Good work, Mrs. Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.305" end="00:21:29.305" style="s2">Next time thugs break in, let the</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.005" end="00:21:29.305" style="s2">machines tie them up for me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.105" end="00:21:33.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.305" end="00:21:36.505" style="s2">thank God you&#39;re okay. Why didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.305" end="00:21:38.879" style="s2">call me last night? Okay, I swear you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.505" end="00:21:40.899" style="s2">be the first call next time.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.879" end="00:21:40.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.605" end="00:21:46.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This way, please.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.905" end="00:21:50.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.205" end="00:21:53.405" style="s2">Elena, where did you get the money for</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.905" end="00:21:55.305" style="s2">gear like this?</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.405" end="00:21:57.505" style="s2">And those two iron giants must have cost</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.305" end="00:21:59.705" style="s2">a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.505" end="00:22:02.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I maxed out every credit card I have.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.705" end="00:22:05.505" style="s2">Those two are top-tier farm robots. I</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.105" end="00:22:05.505" style="s2">have to scale up production.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.605" end="00:22:09.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.805" end="00:22:11.705" style="s2">You had it all planned before you even</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.605" end="00:22:15.305" style="s2">got here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.705" end="00:22:15.305" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll stop worrying about you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.605" end="00:22:21.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Report, master. Today&#39;s spring of life</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.605" end="00:22:23.705" style="s2">has been mixed into the main irrigation</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.305" end="00:22:25.106" style="s2">tank at one part per thousand. Ready on</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.705" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">your word.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.106" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Start field-wide irrigation.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.406" end="00:22:36.806" style="s2">Finally, I did it. From today, you two</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.506" end="00:22:38.106" style="s2">patrol in shifts around the clock. No</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.806" end="00:22:38.706" style="s2">outsider learns what&#39;s behind these</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.106" end="00:22:40.706" style="s2">walls.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.706" end="00:22:42.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest assured, master. Military-grade</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.706" end="00:22:46.106" style="s2">infrared, thermal, and night vision.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.606" end="00:22:46.106" style="s2">Even a rabbit won&#39;t slip in.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.506" end="00:22:56.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From today, you&#39;re Rusty, and he&#39;s Bolt.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.106" end="00:22:56.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, young master Silas. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.806" end="00:23:26.106" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.306" end="00:23:29.506" style="s2">How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.106" end="00:23:34.006" style="s2">5 days ago, this was bare salt flats.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.506" end="00:23:34.006" style="s2">God, this sugar, this firmness</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.161" end="00:23:37.106" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.606" end="00:23:41.106" style="s2">10 times better than the best I&#39;ve seen</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.106" end="00:23:41.106" style="s2">in Napa Valley. It&#39;s untaming.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.306" end="00:23:46.806" style="s2">Mrs. Hayes, no more samples. All 12</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.906" end="00:23:48.606" style="s2">five-star Blue Ocean properties will</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.806" end="00:23:50.406" style="s2">take their premium products from you,</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.606" end="00:23:54.306" style="s2">year round. Three deliveries a week,</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.406" end="00:23:54.306" style="s2">monthly settlement, top market price.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.406" end="00:24:01.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pleasure doing business, Mr. Miller.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.206" end="00:24:05.506" style="s2">Silver Creek won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.606" end="00:24:05.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.506" end="00:24:11.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more thing, Elena. Watch your back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.006" end="00:24:13.206" style="s2">Our previous supplier was Rachel Thorne,</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.006" end="00:24:15.206" style="s2">an old money farmer around here. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.206" end="00:24:16.306" style="s2">dangerous. Anyone who took her business</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.206" end="00:24:20.106" style="s2">never lasted long.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.306" end="00:24:20.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for the warning. I&#39;ll be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.306" end="00:24:24.306" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, Blue Ocean just canceled our</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.306" end="00:24:27.906" style="s2">10-year contract. They moved every order</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.306" end="00:24:27.906" style="s2">to that new widow at Silver Creek.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.406" end="00:24:36.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stealing meat from my plate?</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.707" end="00:24:36.107" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how tough she really is.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.607" end="00:24:44.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, Joe, what happened?</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.908" end="00:24:46.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t ask.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.707" end="00:24:48.607" style="s2">An out-of-town crew showed up and</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.307" end="00:24:51.507" style="s2">undercut us below cost.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.607" end="00:24:54.072" style="s2">They took every client I had.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.507" end="00:24:55.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we don&#39;t land work next month,</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.072" end="00:24:57.807" style="s2">[snorts] we mortgage the house to pay</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.408" end="00:25:00.607" style="s2">the crew.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.807" end="00:25:01.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Mara, eat something sweet. Then you</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.607" end="00:25:04.408" style="s2">won&#39;t be sad.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.707" end="00:25:05.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe, Mara, stop taking odd jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.408" end="00:25:07.908" style="s2">Starting tomorrow, you both work at</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.908" end="00:25:10.107" style="s2">Silver Creek Farm.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.908" end="00:25:12.007" style="s2">I just landed Blue Ocean. I need people</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.107" end="00:25:13.807" style="s2">I trust. Joe runs equipment and</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.007" end="00:25:15.807" style="s2">construction. Mara runs harvest</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.807" end="00:25:18.307" style="s2">scheduling and deliveries. Top market</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.807" end="00:25:19.908" style="s2">wage plus 30 %.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.307" end="00:25:21.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.908" end="00:25:23.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.807" end="00:25:25.207" style="s2">you silly girl.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.707" end="00:25:27.207" style="s2">We can&#39;t take advantage of you like</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.207" end="00:25:29.107" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.207" end="00:25:31.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without you two, Silas and I wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.107" end="00:25:33.707" style="s2">have survived our first day here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.607" end="00:25:35.908" style="s2">I need you to help me hold this place.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.707" end="00:25:38.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Hayes. I won&#39;t waste words.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.908" end="00:25:40.307" style="s2">The Bennetts will remember this forever.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.307" end="00:25:44.107" style="s2">Anyone touches Silver Creek,</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.307" end="00:25:44.107" style="s2">they walk over my dead body first.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.408" end="00:25:51.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, whatever magic grows these</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.807" end="00:25:53.908" style="s2">things, I swear to you, not one word</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.707" end="00:25:55.507" style="s2">about what&#39;s behind those walls ever</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.908" end="00:25:58.107" style="s2">leaves the Bennett family.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.507" end="00:25:58.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.908" end="00:26:02.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silas,</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.007" end="00:26:04.807" style="s2">pinky promise.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.507" end="00:26:08.207" style="s2">Every day after school, we do homework</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.807" end="00:26:12.707" style="s2">together and feed mochi, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.207" end="00:26:12.707" style="s2">Pinky promise. No taking it back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.507" end="00:26:23.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hayes, per my client&#39;s title</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.607" end="00:26:25.507" style="s2">search, the upstream channel of Silver</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.607" end="00:26:27.707" style="s2">Creek runs entirely through Thorn Valley</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.507" end="00:26:29.707" style="s2">Farms private land. As of this moment,</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.707" end="00:26:32.009" style="s2">the Thorn family revokes all water</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.707" end="00:26:34.109" style="s2">rights. You may not draw a single drop.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.009" end="00:26:36.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] Both banks have shared Silver</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.109" end="00:26:38.109" style="s2">Creek for decades. You can&#39;t just cut it</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.309" end="00:26:41.709" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.109" end="00:26:44.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t I? Upstream belongs to the Thorns.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.709" end="00:26:46.609" style="s2">Dear Mrs. Hayes, country rules aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.109" end="00:26:49.409" style="s2">city rules. This is what happens when</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.609" end="00:26:49.409" style="s2">you cross me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.209" end="00:27:04.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, we&#39;re in trouble. The tank&#39;s bone</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.409" end="00:27:08.909" style="s2">dry. No water, and the produce due at</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.709" end="00:27:11.209" style="s2">the hotel in two days dies in the field.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.909" end="00:27:13.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lamp makes one small jug a day, a</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.209" end="00:27:16.909" style="s2">few hundred milliliters. Diluted into</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.509" end="00:27:19.009" style="s2">tons of water, it covers the whole farm.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.909" end="00:27:21.409" style="s2">With no water, that raw liquid saves a</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.009" end="00:27:22.609" style="s2">handful of seedlings at best.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.409" end="00:27:24.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.609" end="00:27:25.009" style="s2">what do we do?</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.009" end="00:27:26.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.009" end="00:27:28.509" style="s2">This farm&#39;s been here for years. There</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.909" end="00:27:30.009" style="s2">has to be a water agreement from when</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.509" end="00:27:32.109" style="s2">the land was bought.</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.009" end="00:27:34.909" style="s2">Mara, watch Silas. I&#39;m going through the</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.109" end="00:27:34.909" style="s2">original records.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.309" end="00:27:39.909" style="s2">Hello. I need the original water rights</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.309" end="00:27:41.809" style="s2">filing from when Silver Creek Farm was</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.909" end="00:27:43.709" style="s2">established 30 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.809" end="00:27:45.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad timing, Ms. Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.709" end="00:27:47.509" style="s2">A pipe burst in our basement last year.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.909" end="00:27:50.109" style="s2">All the 30 year old water filings were</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.509" end="00:27:51.909" style="s2">conveniently soaked and destroyed. No</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.109" end="00:27:55.409" style="s2">official record means whoever owns</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.909" end="00:27:55.409" style="s2">upstream has absolute say.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.909" end="00:28:01.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So he&#39;s in with the Thorns.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.909" end="00:28:01.109" style="s2">No wonder he won&#39;t help me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.809" end="00:28:11.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Report, master. Deep penetrating radar</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.509" end="00:28:14.609" style="s2">shows an underground river 30 m below</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.809" end="00:28:16.309" style="s2">the farm. Enormous reserves. Purity 99</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.609" end="00:28:18.609" style="s2">%.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.309" end="00:28:20.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An underground river? We don&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.609" end="00:28:22.709" style="s2">Thorns upstream at all?</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.009" end="00:28:25.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Correct. Drill through 30 m of rock, and</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.709" end="00:28:27.709" style="s2">Silver Creek has its own water forever.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.509" end="00:28:29.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what are we waiting for? Drill</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.709" end="00:28:31.810" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.709" end="00:28:34.310" style="s2">Tear up the ground if you have to. I</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.810" end="00:28:34.310" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.910" end="00:28:53.010" style="s2">We&#39;ve got water.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.810" end="00:29:00.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.010" end="00:29:02.510" style="s2">word is Elena&#39;s doing just fine out at</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.210" end="00:29:04.410" style="s2">Silver Creek. Blue Ocean even signed</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.510" end="00:29:08.110" style="s2">with her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.410" end="00:29:08.110" style="s2">Want me to send someone to lean on her?</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.810" end="00:29:13.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few thousand dollars of vegetables for</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.810" end="00:29:16.810" style="s2">some country hotel is doing fine.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.910" end="00:29:18.110" style="s2">She&#39;s nowhere near 10 million.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.810" end="00:29:21.510" style="s2">Leave her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.110" end="00:29:21.510" style="s2">That salt will bleed her dry.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.710" end="00:29:31.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Honor, since the records are lost,</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.110" end="00:29:33.610" style="s2">county precedent gives my client, Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.310" end="00:29:35.810" style="s2">Thorn, the permanent right to cut off</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.610" end="00:29:37.810" style="s2">Silver Creek, and we demand Ms. Hayes</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.810" end="00:29:39.610" style="s2">pay for damaging our survey work</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.810" end="00:29:42.710" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.610" end="00:29:45.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hayes, beg me now and hand over the</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.710" end="00:29:49.510" style="s2">Blue Ocean contract, and I might grant</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.510" end="00:29:49.510" style="s2">you two buckets of water a day.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.510" end="00:29:58.210" style="s2">Who says there&#39;s no record?</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.210" end="00:30:00.910" style="s2">I found this last night in my late</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.210" end="00:30:00.910" style="s2">husband&#39;s safe</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.110" end="00:30:07.910" style="s2">The original state deed from when Silver</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.810" end="00:30:07.910" style="s2">Creek Farm was founded.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.710" end="00:30:15.010" style="s2">Article four, in black and white,</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.710" end="00:30:17.510" style="s2">stamped by the state. Silver Creek Farm</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.010" end="00:30:20.910" style="s2">holds 50% of the legal water rights to</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.510" end="00:30:22.110" style="s2">the main channel, permanently.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.910" end="00:30:23.210" style="s2">And I don&#39;t even need your water</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.110" end="00:30:25.410" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.210" end="00:30:29.410" style="s2">My farm hit its own deep well last</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.410" end="00:30:29.410" style="s2">night. I&#39;m here for the principal.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.110" end="00:30:34.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The state deed is valid.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.010" end="00:30:36.810" style="s2">This court rules Thorn Farm&#39;s private</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.110" end="00:30:39.112" style="s2">dam is a serious violation.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.810" end="00:30:42.512" style="s2">Tear it down within 24 hours and a</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.112" end="00:30:42.512" style="s2">$50,000 fine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.612" end="00:30:47.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Finally that blood sucker gets</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.112" end="00:30:47.812" style="s2">what&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.912" end="00:30:53.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t celebrate yet.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.412" end="00:30:53.412" style="s2">This is only the beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.981" end="00:30:57.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.312" end="00:31:02.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Report, master. Modeling our irrigated</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.512" end="00:31:04.812" style="s2">acreage and premium pricing, even if we</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.712" end="00:31:06.912" style="s2">stretch every drop of the serum, at the</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.812" end="00:31:08.812" style="s2">end of the year our net profit caps at</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.912" end="00:31:09.912" style="s2">$2.1 million.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.812" end="00:31:12.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.912" end="00:31:14.612" style="s2">can&#39;t we do it?</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.212" end="00:31:17.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The serum is limited.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.612" end="00:31:18.712" style="s2">But if every drop makes plants supreme,</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.012" end="00:31:20.812" style="s2">we can&#39;t keep growing $5 a pound</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.712" end="00:31:23.112" style="s2">tomatoes and carrots.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.812" end="00:31:24.912" style="s2">Every drop goes on the most expensive</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.112" end="00:31:27.712" style="s2">plants in the world.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.912" end="00:31:30.012" style="s2">Mr. Vale, hello. David Miller sent me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.712" end="00:31:31.912" style="s2">I&#39;m here to buy your rarest plant stock.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.012" end="00:31:33.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If David vouched for you, I&#39;ll show you</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.912" end="00:31:36.012" style="s2">the real goods.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.612" end="00:31:37.412" style="s2">But fair warning, this isn&#39;t for country</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.012" end="00:31:39.012" style="s2">vegetable farmers.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.412" end="00:31:40.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;m not here to window</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.012" end="00:31:42.712" style="s2">shop.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.512" end="00:31:42.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.912" end="00:31:47.112" style="s2">Perigord black truffle cultures and</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.912" end="00:31:49.912" style="s2">century old wild ginseng seedlings from</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.112" end="00:31:52.012" style="s2">the deep Appalachians. Grow either one</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.912" end="00:31:55.012" style="s2">and Michelin kitchens and pharma giants</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.012" end="00:31:55.012" style="s2">will kill for it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.212" end="00:32:00.012" style="s2">Now this, the real treasure. Lab</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.912" end="00:32:03.012" style="s2">cultured Florida ghost orchid bulbs,</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.012" end="00:32:05.712" style="s2">nearly extinct on Earth, absurdly fussy,</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.012" end="00:32:08.012" style="s2">fewer than one in 10,000 ever bloom. But</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.712" end="00:32:10.312" style="s2">at a billionaire&#39;s auction, one perfect</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.012" end="00:32:12.512" style="s2">bloom buys a mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.312" end="00:32:14.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The truffle cultures, the ginseng, these</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.512" end="00:32:15.912" style="s2">orchid bulbs,</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.112" end="00:32:17.812" style="s2">how much for all of it?</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.912" end="00:32:18.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $300,000.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.812" end="00:32:22.912" style="s2">Not a cent less.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.912" end="00:32:22.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? $300,000?</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.112" end="00:32:31.712" style="s2">Empty every account I have and get David</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.512" end="00:32:35.012" style="s2">to advance next quarter&#39;s payment.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.712" end="00:32:35.012" style="s2">Just enough to buy all three.</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.112" end="00:32:39.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good God, Elena, are you insane?</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.712" end="00:32:41.413" style="s2">That&#39;s every penny you saved.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.913" end="00:32:42.913" style="s2">If those delicate orchids and truffles</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.413" end="00:32:45.013" style="s2">die in the ground, we can&#39;t even buy</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.913" end="00:32:47.113" style="s2">bread. Mara,</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.013" end="00:32:48.913" style="s2">to beat that monster in a year, I have</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.113" end="00:32:51.313" style="s2">to bet everything.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.913" end="00:32:52.613" style="s2">The orchid bulbs, the truffle cultures,</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.313" end="00:32:54.013" style="s2">the ginseng,</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.613" end="00:32:55.413" style="s2">all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.013" end="00:32:56.812" style="s2">Paid in full.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.413" end="00:32:58.832" style="s2">And I take it now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.812" end="00:32:58.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.613" end="00:33:06.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Decisive.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:08.602" style="s2">20 years in this business, I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.413" end="00:33:09.313" style="s2">met a woman with more nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.602" end="00:33:11.213" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.313" end="00:33:14.213" style="s2">They&#39;re yours.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.213" end="00:33:14.213" style="s2">Good luck, Mrs. Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.813" end="00:33:36.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grow fast, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.713" end="00:33:38.513" style="s2">Help mommy beat the bad guys.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.113" end="00:33:41.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liam, I&#39;ve bet everything.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.513" end="00:33:41.413" style="s2">Please let this work.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.813" end="00:34:00.513" style="s2">We did it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.113" end="00:34:05.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My god.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.113" end="00:34:07.413" style="s2">Good lord above.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.613" end="00:34:09.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; David, is this good enough for the</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.413" end="00:34:11.313" style="s2">city&#39;s top auction?</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.313" end="00:34:14.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good enough?</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.313" end="00:34:16.313" style="s2">It&#39;s a miracle of the plant world.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.313" end="00:34:19.013" style="s2">Even the finest wild orchid king in the</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.313" end="00:34:21.213" style="s2">Florida preserve would pale beside it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.013" end="00:34:23.113" style="s2">Wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.213" end="00:34:24.813" style="s2">I&#39;ll call in every favor on the hotel</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.113" end="00:34:27.013" style="s2">group&#39;s board and get you into next</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.813" end="00:34:29.413" style="s2">week&#39;s state rare flower charity</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.013" end="00:34:29.413" style="s2">auction.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.313" end="00:34:47.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Crow, may my lot go through</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.314" end="00:34:48.814" style="s2">authentication now?</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.614" end="00:34:52.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pass.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.814" end="00:34:53.714" style="s2">In your dreams. 30 years in this trade,</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.014" end="00:34:55.914" style="s2">greenhouse raised ghost orchids never</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.714" end="00:34:59.314" style="s2">have aerial roots that&#39;s full or that</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.914" end="00:34:59.314" style="s2">natural silver sheen.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.414" end="00:35:06.314" style="s2">This plant was absolutely poached out of</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.114" end="00:35:09.714" style="s2">the Florida preserve swamps. It&#39;s a wild</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.314" end="00:35:09.714" style="s2">endangered specimen.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.714" end="00:35:15.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, she looks so respectable.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.014" end="00:35:16.414" style="s2">Poaching endangered plants? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.314" end="00:35:18.314" style="s2">finished.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.414" end="00:35:20.114" style="s2">Poaching a national treasure orchid is a</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.314" end="00:35:21.914" style="s2">felony.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.114" end="00:35:23.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Crow,</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.914" end="00:35:26.214" style="s2">watch your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.514" end="00:35:29.914" style="s2">I grew this ghost orchid myself from</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.214" end="00:35:30.914" style="s2">bulb in my own greenhouse.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.914" end="00:35:32.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.914" end="00:35:33.914" style="s2">A country housewife in this industry has</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.714" end="00:35:36.714" style="s2">ever heard of?</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.914" end="00:35:36.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody know what the</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.914" end="00:35:41.414" style="s2">I&#39;d bet you can&#39;t even pronounce the</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.714" end="00:35:44.114" style="s2">Latin name and you claim you grew it?</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.414" end="00:35:44.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad man.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.014" end="00:35:49.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m calling the US Fish and Wildlife</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.114" end="00:35:52.514" style="s2">Service right now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.914" end="00:35:55.914" style="s2">Poaching a class one endangered species</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.514" end="00:35:55.914" style="s2">means federal prison.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.414" end="00:36:04.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before you call anyone, open your eyes</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.914" end="00:36:07.114" style="s2">and look at these three documents.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.714" end="00:36:09.114" style="s2">First, an invoice from Marcus Vale, the</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.114" end="00:36:11.914" style="s2">state&#39;s biggest rare plant broker for</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.114" end="00:36:13.914" style="s2">lab-cultured ghost orchid bulbs. Second,</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.914" end="00:36:16.914" style="s2">a legal sterile bulb transfer permit</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.914" end="00:36:19.114" style="s2">issued by the USDA. And third,</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.914" end="00:36:21.814" style="s2">a DNA report from the State University&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.114" end="00:36:23.214" style="s2">plant genetics lab dated yesterday. It</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.814" end="00:36:25.314" style="s2">proves this orchid is a fourth</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.214" end="00:36:28.914" style="s2">generation cultivated hybrid clearly</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.314" end="00:36:28.914" style="s2">distinct from the wild population.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.714" end="00:36:34.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all true, fully legal and</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.414" end="00:36:36.714" style="s2">compliant.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.514" end="00:36:38.814" style="s2">Mr. Crow, this really is a laboratory</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.714" end="00:36:40.914" style="s2">miracle. You misjudged it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.814" end="00:36:43.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, and Mr. Crow, the Latin name is</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.914" end="00:36:45.316" style="s2">Dendrophylax lindenii. As chief</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.214" end="00:36:47.416" style="s2">authenticator of a distinguished house,</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.316" end="00:36:51.216" style="s2">next time you accuse someone, update</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.416" end="00:36:51.216" style="s2">your 30-year-old arrogance first.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.916" end="00:37:02.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mrs. Thorn. Don&#39;t worry. Without</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.716" end="00:37:04.916" style="s2">Thorn money behind me, I&#39;d be nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.816" end="00:37:07.516" style="s2">If she&#39;s bold enough to bring her goods</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.916" end="00:37:09.916" style="s2">onto my turf, tonight I&#39;ll take care of</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.516" end="00:37:13.716" style="s2">this country bumpkin and destroy her in</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.916" end="00:37:13.716" style="s2">front of the whole state tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.416" end="00:37:32.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, wake up. The bad man swapped our</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.416" end="00:37:32.916" style="s2">flower.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.016" end="00:37:42.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A flower this beautiful and Sebastian</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.716" end="00:37:44.116" style="s2">has me dump it at the landfill.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.916" end="00:37:46.516" style="s2">What a waste.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.116" end="00:37:48.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Sebastian&#39;s assistant. Mochi, go.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.516" end="00:37:50.116" style="s2">Keep him busy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.616" end="00:37:52.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did this stray come from? Get</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.116" end="00:37:52.616" style="s2">lost.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.016" end="00:37:58.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.416" end="00:38:00.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fast for a dumb dog. Don&#39;t let me catch</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.416" end="00:38:00.916" style="s2">you again.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.616" end="00:38:11.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, look who it is. Isn&#39;t this our</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.316" end="00:38:13.716" style="s2">once so grand Mrs. Hayes? Heard Clayton</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.216" end="00:38:16.456" style="s2">shipped you off to farm dirt. So now you</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.716" end="00:38:18.216" style="s2">sell wild flowers for spare change.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.456" end="00:38:19.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.216" end="00:38:22.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now the final lot of tonight&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.716" end="00:38:25.516" style="s2">auction, the legendary cultivated ghost</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.216" end="00:38:28.516" style="s2">orchid grown by Miss Elena Hayes of</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.516" end="00:38:32.616" style="s2">Silver Creek Farm. Mr. Crow, chief</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.516" end="00:38:32.616" style="s2">authenticator, will unveil it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.451" end="00:38:38.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.516" end="00:38:40.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the legendary orchid? It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.616" end="00:38:41.916" style="s2">rotting weed.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.016" end="00:38:44.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies and gentlemen,</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.916" end="00:38:46.617" style="s2">yesterday this woman&#39;s forged reports</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.316" end="00:38:49.417" style="s2">fooled me. She brought a rotting weed</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.617" end="00:38:52.317" style="s2">dusted with glow powder into Sotheby&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.417" end="00:38:54.017" style="s2">I&#39;m moved to disqualify her lot at once</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.317" end="00:38:56.617" style="s2">and hand her to the authorities for</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.017" end="00:38:56.617" style="s2">fraud.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.517" end="00:39:02.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get this fraud out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.817" end="00:39:09.217" style="s2">Mr. Crow, so eager to convict me because</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.517" end="00:39:12.917" style="s2">you were so sure of yourself when you</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.217" end="00:39:12.917" style="s2">had the flower swapped last night?</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.617" end="00:39:19.517" style="s2">Ladies and gentlemen, watch this footage</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.417" end="00:39:22.117" style="s2">from the auction house alley at 2:05</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.517" end="00:39:22.117" style="s2">last night.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.617" end="00:39:25.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.117" end="00:39:28.217" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.617" end="00:39:29.117" style="s2">He acted on his own.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.217" end="00:39:32.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shameless. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.117" end="00:39:34.217" style="s2">He&#39;s ruined 100 years of our reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.017" end="00:39:36.117" style="s2">On behalf of the board, Sebastian Crow</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.217" end="00:39:38.517" style="s2">is dismissed immediately, reported to</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.117" end="00:39:40.017" style="s2">the guild for a lifetime ban worldwide</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.517" end="00:39:43.917" style="s2">and handed over to the police.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.017" end="00:39:43.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no. Give me another chance.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.917" end="00:39:51.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This orchid is unbelievable. Start the</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.617" end="00:39:55.217" style="s2">bidding. I&#39;ll pay 300,000. 300,000 for</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.817" end="00:39:59.017" style="s2">this quality? 500,000. I bid 500.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.217" end="00:40:02.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1.2 million. Nobody bid against me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.017" end="00:40:04.817" style="s2">1.2 million once. Three times sold.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.317" end="00:40:06.717" style="s2">Congratulations to Elena Hayes for the</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.817" end="00:40:09.317" style="s2">highest single plant auction records</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.717" end="00:40:09.317" style="s2">this year.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.017" end="00:40:22.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless. That idiot Sebastian couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.317" end="00:40:23.917" style="s2">do one thing right. Let that [ __ ] climb</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.017" end="00:40:26.617" style="s2">OVER HIM AND WALK OFF WITH OVER A</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.917" end="00:40:26.617" style="s2">MILLION.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.917" end="00:40:33.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care how. Find out what&#39;s really</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.117" end="00:40:33.717" style="s2">under that farm. Now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.662" end="00:40:36.682" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.117" end="00:40:41.517" style="s2">Silas, watch your step.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.417" end="00:40:43.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, the trees look perfect. The</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.517" end="00:40:46.617" style="s2">truffles below must be ripe by now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.917" end="00:40:49.218" style="s2">But they&#39;re buried half a meter deep.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.617" end="00:40:52.518" style="s2">Digging by hand is slow and one careless</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.218" end="00:40:54.818" style="s2">ruins the skin, then it&#39;s worthless.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.518" end="00:40:57.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked David. A trained French truffle</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.818" end="00:40:59.918" style="s2">dog costs tens of thousands and there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.218" end="00:40:59.918" style="s2">a waiting list.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.318" end="00:41:04.718" style="s2">Mochi, I think I found you a job.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.218" end="00:41:13.018" style="s2">Mochi, watch me. Step one, remember this</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.918" end="00:41:15.018" style="s2">smell. Step two, find it. Step three,</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.018" end="00:41:17.618" style="s2">dig with your paw. Do it right and you</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.018" end="00:41:17.618" style="s2">get jerky.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.818" end="00:41:26.018" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. Let&#39;s try again. Mochi&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.118" end="00:41:26.018" style="s2">smartest dog ever. You&#39;ll get it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.418" end="00:41:36.218" style="s2">Silas, Mochi, dinner&#39;s ready. Mochi,</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.318" end="00:41:36.218" style="s2">let&#39;s go home. We&#39;ll try again tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.418" end="00:41:43.618" style="s2">Mommy, look. Mochi found one.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.318" end="00:42:00.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Dubois, welcome to Silver Creek</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.318" end="00:42:00.318" style="s2">Farm. I&#39;m Elena Hayes, the owner.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.418" end="00:42:04.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s skip the pleasantries, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.518" end="00:42:06.718" style="s2">If David hadn&#39;t raved about your sample,</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.818" end="00:42:09.518" style="s2">I would never waste my prep time in the</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.718" end="00:42:11.418" style="s2">middle of nowhere like this.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.518" end="00:42:13.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, Mr. Dubois.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.418" end="00:42:15.618" style="s2">I don&#39;t think you&#39;ll be disappointed.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.318" end="00:42:17.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me be blunt. My three-star kitchen</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.618" end="00:42:19.418" style="s2">uses only Périgord truffles flown in</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.418" end="00:42:21.318" style="s2">from France. As far as I&#39;m concerned,</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.418" end="00:42:23.418" style="s2">so-called American country truffles are</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.318" end="00:42:25.918" style="s2">tasteless wood fit for pigs.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.418" end="00:42:25.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.118" end="00:42:33.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good god, the soil moisture&#39;s all wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.318" end="00:42:35.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And these oaks are far too young to host</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.118" end="00:42:37.618" style="s2">mature mycelium.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.218" end="00:42:40.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the most absurd part?</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.618" end="00:42:44.318" style="s2">A sheepdog as a truffle hound?</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.418" end="00:42:44.318" style="s2">That&#39;s a desecration of culinary art.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:47.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.618" end="00:42:50.218" style="s2">watch your mouth, old man. If you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.518" end="00:42:52.320" style="s2">buying, go back to France.</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.218" end="00:42:54.920" style="s2">Chef Dubois, great ingredients don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.320" end="00:42:56.620" style="s2">need defending with words. Tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.920" end="00:43:00.120" style="s2">what would satisfy you?</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.620" end="00:43:01.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Simple. I want a perfect truffle. One,</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.120" end="00:43:04.920" style="s2">I watch it come out of this ground</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.820" end="00:43:07.220" style="s2">myself. Two, perfectly round without a</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.920" end="00:43:10.120" style="s2">single bruise. Three,</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.220" end="00:43:13.020" style="s2">rich aroma and marbling inside as clear</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.120" end="00:43:16.920" style="s2">as fine art. Anything less and I walk</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.020" end="00:43:16.920" style="s2">out and expose you publicly.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.020" end="00:43:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on, Mochi. Show the gentleman what</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.220" end="00:43:24.720" style="s2">you can do.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.320" end="00:43:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, get that dumb dog away from my</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.420" end="00:43:33.920" style="s2">talk.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.020" end="00:43:46.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One egg, one pat of butter, one shaver.</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.420" end="00:43:49.020" style="s2">Truffles don&#39;t lie.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.220" end="00:43:50.920" style="s2">Only complicated cooking lies for them.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.020" end="00:43:53.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this old man says it&#39;s bad, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.920" end="00:43:56.020" style="s2">hitting him with a spatula.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.420" end="00:43:56.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him cook.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.230" end="00:44:08.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.220" end="00:44:13.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat slowly, my little chef.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.520" end="00:44:16.820" style="s2">Remember, the best things never need</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.820" end="00:44:18.320" style="s2">fancy names. Eat slowly. The best things</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.820" end="00:44:20.220" style="s2">never need fancy names.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.320" end="00:44:23.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, this is the best breakfast in</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.220" end="00:44:23.020" style="s2">the world.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.570" end="00:44:26.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.820" end="00:44:29.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t misunderstand. I&#39;m not crying. The</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.920" end="00:44:31.620" style="s2">truffle steam, it&#39;s strong.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.720" end="00:44:33.820" style="s2">This taste.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.620" end="00:44:35.220" style="s2">When I was a boy in rural Périgord, my</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.820" end="00:44:37.620" style="s2">grandmother made it for me every</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.220" end="00:44:37.620" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.320" end="00:44:41.720" style="s2">Then she passed.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.720" end="00:44:43.920" style="s2">I opened a three-star restaurant. 40</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.720" end="00:44:46.620" style="s2">years, half of Europe, and I never found</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.920" end="00:44:49.020" style="s2">this exact taste again. Mrs. Hayes,</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.620" end="00:44:51.020" style="s2">I take back fit for pigs. No, I take</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.020" end="00:44:53.420" style="s2">back every word I said today.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.020" end="00:44:55.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Taking it back is easy. If If this taste</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.420" end="00:44:55.921" style="s2">on your menu for good, we talk</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.021" end="00:44:57.821" style="s2">contracts.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.921" end="00:45:00.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll send the contract. Exclusive</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.821" end="00:45:02.921" style="s2">supply, every truffle at the highest US</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.221" end="00:45:04.521" style="s2">price. One condition. Every menu in</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.921" end="00:45:05.821" style="s2">every one of my restaurants, Prince</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.521" end="00:45:07.921" style="s2">Silver Creek.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.821" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dubois, I have to warn you. Supply will</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.921" end="00:45:10.921" style="s2">be very limited.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.321" end="00:45:13.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; less the better.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.921" end="00:45:16.321" style="s2">my guests could eat it any day,</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.321" end="00:45:16.321" style="s2">it wouldn&#39;t be legendary.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.921" end="00:45:24.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Department, Dawson speaking.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.021" end="00:45:27.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Creek Farm is using growth hormones</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.821" end="00:45:28.321" style="s2">illegally. Go check. You&#39;ll catch them</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.121" end="00:45:31.821" style="s2">red-handed.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.321" end="00:45:31.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is this? Do you have proof?</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.921" end="00:45:46.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Hayes, I&#39;m Ray Dawson, County</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.721" end="00:45:48.521" style="s2">Agriculture. We received a tip that</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.621" end="00:45:50.221" style="s2">Silver Creek is using growth hormones.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.521" end="00:45:51.821" style="s2">All products are off sale, effective</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.221" end="00:45:53.921" style="s2">now, pending tests.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.821" end="00:45:56.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Dawson, go ahead. Fields, barn,</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.921" end="00:45:59.021" style="s2">water tank, sample wherever you like.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.121" end="00:45:59.021" style="s2">Full cooperation.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.221" end="00:46:03.621" style="s2">David&#39;s truck is already on the road. 12</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.421" end="00:46:05.821" style="s2">hotels are waiting on tonight&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.621" end="00:46:09.821" style="s2">delivery. If we&#39;re shut down, what&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.821" end="00:46:09.821" style="s2">penalty? One crisis at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.821" end="00:46:21.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Little man, you&#39;re staring at me like a</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.621" end="00:46:23.621" style="s2">hawk. Afraid I&#39;ll eat all your grapes?</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.121" end="00:46:24.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pick them gently. The grapes can feel</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.621" end="00:46:27.121" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.321" end="00:46:28.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ll be gentle.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.121" end="00:46:32.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.421" end="00:46:32.121" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the serum leave a trace.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.721" end="00:46:36.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send it all to the state lab. Rush</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.521" end="00:46:36.921" style="s2">order.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.521" end="00:46:47.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, 12 purchasing managers are</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.221" end="00:46:48.721" style="s2">calling me one after another. If these</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.021" end="00:46:49.121" style="s2">results don&#39;t come in, I can&#39;t hold them</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.721" end="00:46:51.321" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.121" end="00:46:54.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; David, give me one more day. The results</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.321" end="00:46:54.421" style="s2">will speak for themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.221" end="00:46:57.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.223" end="00:47:06.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pesticide residue, zero. Hormones, zero.</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.823" end="00:47:08.723" style="s2">Heavy metals, zero. Antioxidants, triple</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.122" end="00:47:11.023" style="s2">the organic standard. Soil samples,</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.723" end="00:47:12.023" style="s2">completely normal.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.023" end="00:47:14.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell her.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.023" end="00:47:17.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 25 years in this job, thousands of farms</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.823" end="00:47:19.223" style="s2">inspected, and I&#39;ve never seen salt</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.122" end="00:47:22.622" style="s2">flats produce results like these. Miss</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.223" end="00:47:22.622" style="s2">Hayes, I owe you an apology.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.122" end="00:47:28.922" style="s2">Also, I filed a rush application for</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.122" end="00:47:32.323" style="s2">your state organic certification,</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.922" end="00:47:34.523" style="s2">approved within a week at the latest.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.323" end="00:47:36.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Dawson.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.523" end="00:47:38.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, orders from the hotels have</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.723" end="00:47:39.763" style="s2">doubled. Everyone&#39;s asking how SILVER</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.723" end="00:47:41.783" style="s2">CREEK PASSED.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.763" end="00:47:41.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.723" end="00:47:48.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MISS HAYES, THERE&#39;S SOMETHING YOU SHOULD</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.023" end="00:47:49.323" style="s2">KNOW.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.523" end="00:47:51.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT?</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.323" end="00:47:53.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That tip came from someone who got paid.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.723" end="00:47:54.823" style="s2">I can&#39;t say more.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.622" end="00:47:58.122" style="s2">Only this.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.823" end="00:47:58.122" style="s2">The name behind it is Thorn.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.323" end="00:48:08.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One jug a day.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.122" end="00:48:11.323" style="s2">Output can&#39;t keep up with the orders</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.622" end="00:48:11.323" style="s2">pouring in.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.523" end="00:48:16.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, we&#39;re booked a month out.</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.422" end="00:48:18.323" style="s2">Hotels, restaurants, premium markets,</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.922" end="00:48:20.323" style="s2">all pushing.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.323" end="00:48:21.422" style="s2">Should we double the acreage?</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.323" end="00:48:23.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara,</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.422" end="00:48:24.523" style="s2">why does everyone line up for a Hermès</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.323" end="00:48:26.122" style="s2">bag?</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.523" end="00:48:27.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not because they can&#39;t make more,</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.122" end="00:48:29.723" style="s2">because they won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.723" end="00:48:30.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we&#39;re selling produce.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.723" end="00:48:33.723" style="s2">Will that work?</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.922" end="00:48:33.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to try.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.122" end="00:48:41.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got this, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.323" end="00:48:45.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for coming.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.323" end="00:48:45.323" style="s2">Now my team will show you our products.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.523" end="00:48:52.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hayes,</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.823" end="00:48:54.122" style="s2">$500 for a box of grapes?</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.622" end="00:48:56.622" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that outrageous?</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.122" end="00:48:59.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, taste one first, then tell me if</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.622" end="00:48:59.122" style="s2">it&#39;s worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.422" end="00:49:06.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.924" end="00:49:07.524" style="s2">How is this possible? It&#39;s like magic.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.224" end="00:49:09.524" style="s2">Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.524" end="00:49:13.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll just say this. We don&#39;t sell</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.524" end="00:49:13.324" style="s2">volume. We sell the best.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.024" end="00:49:29.324" style="s2">We need more hands. Start hiring now.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.524" end="00:49:36.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hayes, I&#39;m Travis Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.724" end="00:49:38.924" style="s2">I&#39;ll take any work. No job too hard, no</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.224" end="00:49:38.924" style="s2">shift too long.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.024" end="00:49:41.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Start tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.524" end="00:49:47.544" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.024" end="00:49:51.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, leave the heavy lifting to me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.024" end="00:49:54.724" style="s2">Don&#39;t hurt your back.</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.124" end="00:49:56.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aw, what a sweet kid.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.724" end="00:49:58.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the way, I barely see those two big</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.524" end="00:50:00.224" style="s2">guys during the day. What do they do at</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.524" end="00:50:02.724" style="s2">night? Don&#39;t they sleep?</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.224" end="00:50:04.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Travis, you haul the crates. Don&#39;t ask</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.724" end="00:50:06.924" style="s2">about farm business.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.424" end="00:50:07.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, Mara. Just curious. No offense</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.924" end="00:50:11.424" style="s2">meant.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.524" end="00:50:11.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.274" end="00:50:20.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.424" end="00:50:32.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, at 2:05 last night, Bolt was in</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.424" end="00:50:33.624" style="s2">silent calibration mode for serum</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.124" end="00:50:36.124" style="s2">injection.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.624" end="00:50:37.924" style="s2">All sensors paused external scanning,</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.124" end="00:50:40.324" style="s2">and the perimeter cameras happened to go</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.924" end="00:50:42.124" style="s2">blind for 3 minutes. I only found the</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.324" end="00:50:45.124" style="s2">anomaly this morning reviewing the</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.124" end="00:50:45.124" style="s2">infrared footage.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.524" end="00:50:51.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That liar.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.924" end="00:50:54.724" style="s2">And I thought he was such a sweet kid.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.824" end="00:50:55.824" style="s2">I&#39;m calling the police.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.724" end="00:50:58.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold off.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.824" end="00:51:00.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? He filmed this place.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.224" end="00:51:02.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re keeping him? Arresting Travis</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.324" end="00:51:04.725" style="s2">won&#39;t touch whoever&#39;s behind him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.424" end="00:51:06.025" style="s2">We can&#39;t them know he&#39;s been caught.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.725" end="00:51:08.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.025" end="00:51:09.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him carry the news back.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.025" end="00:51:12.125" style="s2">Only</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.025" end="00:51:14.425" style="s2">it&#39;ll be what we want them to see.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.125" end="00:51:15.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, shall I produce an undetectable</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.425" end="00:51:18.725" style="s2">formula?</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.125" end="00:51:18.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;ll write it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.425" end="00:51:25.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, this mix runs 40 times the safe</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.225" end="00:51:27.825" style="s2">nitrogen phosphorus level. Any crop</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.325" end="00:51:29.925" style="s2">given it dies at the root within 3 days.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.825" end="00:51:32.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only wrote a formula. What others do</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.925" end="00:51:33.825" style="s2">with it is their business.</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.025" end="00:51:36.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, Joe.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.825" end="00:51:39.025" style="s2">Water delivery.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.525" end="00:51:41.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe, not a word about that green liquid</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.025" end="00:51:44.225" style="s2">bolt poured in last night. That formula</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.225" end="00:51:46.125" style="s2">cost me a million dollars overseas.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.225" end="00:51:47.725" style="s2">It&#39;s why everything grows here. It&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.125" end="00:51:51.425" style="s2">farm&#39;s core secret.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.725" end="00:51:51.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. My lips are sealed.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.625" end="00:51:59.625" style="s2">Mrs. Thorn,</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.925" end="00:52:02.025" style="s2">Silver Creek Secret.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.625" end="00:52:02.025" style="s2">All of it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.625" end="00:52:06.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A secret formula?</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.825" end="00:52:09.525" style="s2">No wonder that little [ __ ] grows</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.325" end="00:52:11.625" style="s2">anything on salt flats.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.525" end="00:52:13.125" style="s2">Contact the overseas supplier now. Buy</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.625" end="00:52:15.525" style="s2">everything on that list, whatever it</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.125" end="00:52:17.925" style="s2">costs.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.525" end="00:52:19.625" style="s2">Every field gets treated tonight. Ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.925" end="00:52:24.625" style="s2">the raw materials alone run over</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.625" end="00:52:24.625" style="s2">600,000. I said whatever it costs.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.325" end="00:52:30.725" style="s2">Your first payment, the rest when it &#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.225" end="00:52:30.725" style="s2">done, not a cent short.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.825" end="00:52:41.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.725" end="00:52:43.125" style="s2">every root in the field is rotten.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.125" end="00:52:44.925" style="s2">3 days after we use that mix, it&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.125" end="00:52:48.225" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.925" end="00:52:48.225" style="s2">The whole season is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.425" end="00:52:53.511" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. That can&#39;t be. They sold me</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.625" end="00:52:55.531" style="s2">a fake formula.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.511" end="00:52:55.531" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.725" end="00:53:02.625" style="s2">Everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.025" end="00:53:02.625" style="s2">I called you here to watch a video.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.225" end="00:53:09.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That that&#39;s forged.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.127" end="00:53:11.727" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, let me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.927" end="00:53:13.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain what?</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.727" end="00:53:18.027" style="s2">That you smile at me all day and film my</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.927" end="00:53:18.027" style="s2">secrets at night to sell to the thorns?</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.727" end="00:53:22.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I treated you like a brother and you</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.727" end="00:53:24.727" style="s2">stab us in the back?</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.227" end="00:53:27.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. Get off Silver Creek Farm right</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.727" end="00:53:27.027" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.027" end="00:53:38.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Thorn.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.427" end="00:53:40.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Travis, what garbage did you sell me? 3</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.327" end="00:53:42.327" style="s2">days and I burned an entire season. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.827" end="00:53:45.027" style="s2">out over a million.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.327" end="00:53:46.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, she fooled me too. That formula,</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.027" end="00:53:48.727" style="s2">she set me up.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.127" end="00:53:51.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care who fooled whom. You get no</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.727" end="00:53:54.027" style="s2">final payment and in this town you won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.327" end="00:53:54.027" style="s2">last a day.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.427" end="00:54:06.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Reed Group.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.627" end="00:54:09.527" style="s2">I&#39;ve got Silver Creek Farm secret.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.927" end="00:54:09.527" style="s2">Want to buy it?</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.027" end="00:54:22.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.227" end="00:54:25.027" style="s2">Is this from the seedlings I planted?</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.727" end="00:54:27.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, analysis complete.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.027" end="00:54:29.527" style="s2">This ginseng saponin content is 10 times</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.327" end="00:54:31.627" style="s2">a normal wild root.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.527" end="00:54:33.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 times?</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.627" end="00:54:34.327" style="s2">The buyer for this isn&#39;t DuBois&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.027" end="00:54:37.727" style="s2">kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.327" end="00:54:37.727" style="s2">It&#39;s pharmaceutical companies.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.327" end="00:54:43.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena calling me at this hour.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.827" end="00:54:45.527" style="s2">This better be big.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.227" end="00:54:47.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; David, I need introductions to top</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.527" end="00:54:50.627" style="s2">pharmaceutical companies. I want them to</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.727" end="00:54:53.127" style="s2">see this report themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.627" end="00:54:55.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 times the saponins? Elena, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.127" end="00:54:59.527" style="s2">growing gold. Give me 10 minutes. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.727" end="00:54:59.527" style="s2">sending this to three friends in pharma.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.427" end="00:55:10.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, this is a transcript of a</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.028" end="00:55:13.128" style="s2">voicemail that hit the switchboard at</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.528" end="00:55:16.528" style="s2">3:00 a.m. A man named Travis Cole says</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.128" end="00:55:16.528" style="s2">he has Hayes Farm secret.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.528" end="00:55:21.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A drunk&#39;s rambling.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.328" end="00:55:22.728" style="s2">You bother me with this?</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.228" end="00:55:25.528" style="s2">By the way,</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.728" end="00:55:27.028" style="s2">anything new from that wreck of a farm?</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.528" end="00:55:28.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.028" end="00:55:29.828" style="s2">sold an orchid last month.</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.528" end="00:55:31.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One orchid?</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.828" end="00:55:33.628" style="s2">A whole year for one orchid?</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.728" end="00:55:35.228" style="s2">What waves can that make?</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.628" end="00:55:37.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But that orchid sold</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.228" end="00:55:38.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa, don&#39;t bring me anything less</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.428" end="00:55:40.428" style="s2">than important.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.728" end="00:55:42.028" style="s2">I&#39;m dealing with the board. I don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.428" end="00:55:44.628" style="s2">time for trifles.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.028" end="00:55:44.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.428" end="00:56:06.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Hayes,</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.628" end="00:56:09.228" style="s2">I&#39;m the president of Blake Pharma.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.028" end="00:56:09.228" style="s2">I&#39;m here about that report.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.728" end="00:56:19.828" style="s2">I&#39;ve read this report four times.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.128" end="00:56:21.528" style="s2">10 times the saponins of wild ginseng,</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.828" end="00:56:24.428" style="s2">if the numbers hold,</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.528" end="00:56:26.128" style="s2">this is a revolution in pharmaceuticals.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.428" end="00:56:28.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The numbers hold.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.128" end="00:56:30.028" style="s2">Send anyone you like to verify.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.128" end="00:56:31.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I also looked into you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.028" end="00:56:34.928" style="s2">Clayton Reed&#39;s wager,</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.928" end="00:56:36.928" style="s2">$10 million net in one year,</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.928" end="00:56:38.528" style="s2">or you owe a million.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.928" end="00:56:39.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you always do this much homework, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.528" end="00:56:41.628" style="s2">Blake?</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.228" end="00:56:44.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before I buy, I like to know every risk</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.628" end="00:56:44.128" style="s2">behind it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.528" end="00:56:49.928" style="s2">$5 million in cash,</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.428" end="00:56:51.828" style="s2">land, technology, the whole farm.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.928" end="00:56:54.828" style="s2">Take Silas back to the city, clear your</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.828" end="00:56:54.828" style="s2">debts, live quietly.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.028" end="00:57:00.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Blake, thank you for the offer.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.428" end="00:57:02.628" style="s2">But this land is what my husband left</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.928" end="00:57:04.128" style="s2">our son.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.628" end="00:57:05.528" style="s2">It&#39;s not for sale.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.128" end="00:57:07.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $5 million,</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.528" end="00:57:09.329" style="s2">you&#39;d never worry about money again.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.728" end="00:57:10.929" style="s2">You&#39;re sure you want to refuse?</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.329" end="00:57:12.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.929" end="00:57:14.329" style="s2">He wants the land.</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.829" end="00:57:15.829" style="s2">But what&#39;s really worth money is under</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.329" end="00:57:17.629" style="s2">the barn floor.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.829" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">Selling the farm means selling our only</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.629" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">way back up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.629" end="00:57:26.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show me your ginseng field.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.329" end="00:57:38.629" style="s2">Years since anyone dared turn me down to</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.229" end="00:57:41.229" style="s2">my face.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.629" end="00:57:41.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you have.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.629" end="00:57:47.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s do business.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.229" end="00:57:50.529" style="s2">100 kilos of ginseng at this report</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.429" end="00:57:53.329" style="s2">standard inside 30 days. Deliver and we</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.529" end="00:57:53.329" style="s2">sign long term.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.529" end="00:58:00.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Blake, results are in. The sample</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.729" end="00:58:02.529" style="s2">saponins are under half the contract</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.329" end="00:58:04.129" style="s2">standard. This batch is substandard.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.529" end="00:58:07.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.129" end="00:58:07.629" style="s2">I packed those crates myself.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.329" end="00:58:14.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not my ginseng.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.629" end="00:58:16.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hayes, what do you mean by that?</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.829" end="00:58:19.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My roots have dense overlapping rings on</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.729" end="00:58:22.229" style="s2">the rhizome. This sample has sparse even</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.029" end="00:58:24.429" style="s2">rings, clearly ordinary farm stock. Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.229" end="00:58:26.229" style="s2">Blake, I want random samples pulled from</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.429" end="00:58:27.329" style="s2">the whole shipment and retested in front</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.229" end="00:58:29.929" style="s2">of you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.329" end="00:58:29.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her pick.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.129" end="00:58:42.129" style="s2">Saponins,</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.529" end="00:58:42.129" style="s2">10% above the original report.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.829" end="00:58:48.229" style="s2">Mr. Blake, this is a misunderstanding. I</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.229" end="00:58:52.029" style="s2">only</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.229" end="00:58:52.029" style="s2">How much did my competitor pay you?</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.229" end="00:58:55.929" style="s2">Take him out. Call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.629" end="00:58:58.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the Dead Lake.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.929" end="00:59:01.329" style="s2">In the Mermaid Dead Lake.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.529" end="00:59:03.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hayes, my management failed you. By</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.329" end="00:59:05.829" style="s2">way of apology, every term you asked for</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.529" end="00:59:06.829" style="s2">stands. We sign the formal contract</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.829" end="00:59:09.029" style="s2">shortly.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.829" end="00:59:11.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pleasure doing business, Mr. Blake.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.029" end="00:59:11.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pleasure&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.029" end="00:59:15.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Blake, the old man had a heart</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.831" end="00:59:15.931" style="s2">attack.</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.431" end="00:59:17.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old man?</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.931" end="00:59:20.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s in the emergency room. The doctors</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.931" end="00:59:23.131" style="s2">say he may not last the night.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.431" end="00:59:23.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.231" end="00:59:29.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Blake, your father is in end stage</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.331" end="00:59:30.531" style="s2">heart failure. Standard drugs do nothing</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.431" end="00:59:32.831" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.531" end="00:59:34.531" style="s2">He has until dawn at most.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.831" end="00:59:36.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have a ginseng cardiac formula in the</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.531" end="00:59:37.931" style="s2">pipeline. It&#39;s stuck on raw material</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.831" end="00:59:39.431" style="s2">purity.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.931" end="00:59:40.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the shipment I just delivered pure</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.431" end="00:59:41.731" style="s2">enough?</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.231" end="00:59:43.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.731" end="00:59:45.131" style="s2">But extraction takes all night and the</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.531" end="00:59:48.731" style="s2">trials were never approved.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.131" end="00:59:49.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With family consent, can we try it?</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.731" end="00:59:53.231" style="s2">Well,</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.631" end="00:59:53.231" style="s2">family signs it&#39;s allowed.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.831" end="00:59:59.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Purity 99.2%. I&#39;ve never seen material</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.531" end="00:59:59.231" style="s2">this clean.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.331" end="01:00:05.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father says medicine saves people.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.231" end="01:00:08.531" style="s2">It isn&#39;t for profit.</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.931" end="01:00:09.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.531" end="01:00:12.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s my father?</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.731" end="01:00:16.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Blake, this drug is incredible. It</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.131" end="01:00:19.131" style="s2">worked. Your father is stable.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.131" end="01:00:21.431" style="s2">Thank God, Mr. Blake.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.131" end="01:00:22.731" style="s2">Mr. Blake, please don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.431" end="01:00:24.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I owe you one.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.731" end="01:00:26.931" style="s2">Whatever happens from now on, call this</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.731" end="01:00:26.931" style="s2">number.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.331" end="01:00:31.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Birthday boy, it&#39;s your turn to speak.</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.231" end="01:00:33.331" style="s2">Go on, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.631" end="01:00:36.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.331" end="01:00:39.431" style="s2">Thank you, Lila. Thank you, Aunt Ruth.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.531" end="01:00:40.431" style="s2">I love everything here because of all of</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.431" end="01:00:41.841" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.431" end="01:00:43.861" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.841" end="01:00:43.861" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.031" end="01:00:49.331" style="s2">Baby Mommy loves you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.331" end="01:00:55.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The damn board already suspects me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.931" end="01:00:58.931" style="s2">Where did Liam hide that USB drive?</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.431" end="01:00:58.931" style="s2">If the board gets to it first</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.631" end="01:01:03.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, the raid is on Silver Creek Farm.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.931" end="01:01:06.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget that farm.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.531" end="01:01:07.831" style="s2">That stupid woman can&#39;t slip my grip.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.031" end="01:01:10.831" style="s2">I told you to search Liam&#39;s office for a</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.831" end="01:01:12.231" style="s2">silver USB drive. Did you find it?</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.831" end="01:01:14.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.231" end="01:01:14.931" style="s2">I turned the office upside down.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.331" end="01:01:16.332" style="s2">Nothing&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.931" end="01:01:17.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Idiot. Remember, we hang</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.332" end="01:01:19.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; together. What&#39;s on it can destroy us</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.932" end="01:01:20.432" style="s2">both. If anyone finds it, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.532" end="01:01:22.232" style="s2">finished.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.432" end="01:01:24.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I&#39;ll hire a private investigator</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.232" end="01:01:24.832" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.532" end="01:01:31.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember Daddy&#39;s photo was in here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.032" end="01:01:38.732" style="s2">What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.032" end="01:01:42.632" style="s2">Is this a present from Daddy?</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.232" end="01:01:45.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.632" end="01:01:45.432" style="s2">Let me try to open it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.132" end="01:01:51.632" style="s2">Silas&#39;s birthday, our anniversary, none</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.732" end="01:01:54.832" style="s2">of them work.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.632" end="01:01:54.832" style="s2">Liam, what were you hiding?</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.832" end="01:02:02.932" style="s2">Let&#39;s leave it. Mommy&#39;s making you</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.332" end="01:02:02.932" style="s2">breakfast.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.132" end="01:02:10.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Thorne, I&#39;ve lost everything. Last</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.132" end="01:02:12.032" style="s2">time wasn&#39;t on purpose. Please spare me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.832" end="01:02:14.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Travis, I think you&#39;ve learned your</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.032" end="01:02:15.832" style="s2">lesson. We have a common enemy. I&#39;m here</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.332" end="01:02:17.432" style="s2">to give you one more chance.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.832" end="01:02:19.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silver Creek is different now. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.432" end="01:02:21.432" style="s2">want more trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.532" end="01:02:23.432" style="s2">Tell me, what do we do?</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.432" end="01:02:26.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t touch her. We take down her</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.432" end="01:02:28.532" style="s2">name. One repentant ex-employee, a few</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.232" end="01:02:30.932" style="s2">brutal close-ups, and the internet does</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.532" end="01:02:35.532" style="s2">the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:35.532" style="s2">Elena, we&#39;re in trouble. Come see this.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.632" end="01:02:40.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a former Silver Creek employee. They</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.132" end="01:02:43.332" style="s2">inject the fruit with hormones. My</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.432" end="01:02:46.432" style="s2">conscience won&#39;t let me stay quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.332" end="01:02:48.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 11 cancellations this morning, 11. Even</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.432" end="01:02:49.332" style="s2">Antoine&#39;s guests are asking if the food</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.032" end="01:02:51.332" style="s2">is poisoned.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.332" end="01:02:53.532" style="s2">Six months</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.332" end="01:02:54.432" style="s2">and we&#39;d only just found our feet.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.532" end="01:02:56.432" style="s2">Harrison?</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.432" end="01:02:58.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, Blake Pharma got shorted over</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.432" end="01:03:01.332" style="s2">buying Silver Creek material. The stock</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.632" end="01:03:04.032" style="s2">fell 12% in a day. The board is forcing</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.332" end="01:03:04.032" style="s2">me to cut ties.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.032" end="01:03:08.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lawyers drafted a statement</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.532" end="01:03:11.332" style="s2">overnight. Send it. Wait any longer and</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.932" end="01:03:13.332" style="s2">we really are a dirty farm. A statement</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.332" end="01:03:14.932" style="s2">just proves we&#39;re guilty in their eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.332" end="01:03:16.732" style="s2">Then don&#39;t tell them.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.932" end="01:03:17.732" style="s2">Let them come look.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.732" end="01:03:19.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.732" end="01:03:20.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Livestream.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.033" end="01:03:21.633" style="s2">Open the farm gates to the entire</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.533" end="01:03:23.333" style="s2">internet.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.633" end="01:03:26.133" style="s2">I&#39;m Elena Hayes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.333" end="01:03:29.333" style="s2">No statement today. Just open doors.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.133" end="01:03:29.333" style="s2">Come to Silver Creek Farm.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.333" end="01:03:42.333" style="s2">Here&#39;s last week&#39;s state lab report and</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.333" end="01:03:44.433" style="s2">here&#39;s the organic certification. Zero</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.333" end="01:03:46.233" style="s2">residue, zero hormones. Fruit picked</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.433" end="01:03:48.633" style="s2">today is already at the lab. When</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.233" end="01:03:50.433" style="s2">results come in, I announce them live.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.633" end="01:03:51.733" style="s2">Come inspect anytime.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.433" end="01:03:55.133" style="s2">Baby,</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.733" end="01:03:55.133" style="s2">want to show everyone what you can do?</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.689" end="01:03:59.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.933" end="01:04:06.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His name is Mochi.</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.233" end="01:04:11.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.233" end="01:04:17.733" style="s2">Lab reports, organic surfs, live</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.033" end="01:04:21.233" style="s2">samples.</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.733" end="01:04:21.233" style="s2">Nobody that open has anything to hide.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.633" end="01:04:34.433" style="s2">Wait, isn&#39;t this</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.033" end="01:04:38.533" style="s2">Hyo Ming door? There&#39;s more.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.533" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">Hyo Mun door.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.933" end="01:04:45.133" style="s2">Greenway Market, same barcode, $12.99 on</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.133" end="01:04:47.333" style="s2">the shelf.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.133" end="01:04:50.033" style="s2">Those injected farm grapes came from a</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.333" end="01:04:50.033" style="s2">supermarket.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.833" end="01:04:54.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, check the trending page.</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.433" end="01:04:59.533" style="s2">The reservation list, the resin right in</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.533" end="01:05:02.433" style="s2">March</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.533" end="01:05:02.433" style="s2">tripled overnight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.733" end="01:05:14.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rachel, you played too big this time.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.833" end="01:05:15.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Thorne, your failed short attack and</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.133" end="01:05:18.133" style="s2">multiple violations leave you facing</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.933" end="01:05:20.535" style="s2">massive damages. All your assets are</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.133" end="01:05:23.735" style="s2">frozen for liquidation. This farm is now</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.535" end="01:05:23.735" style="s2">formally repossessed.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.535" end="01:05:44.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 million to go.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.735" end="01:05:48.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, Blake Farm&#39;s next order, 3</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.635" end="01:05:50.435" style="s2">million dollars, top grade wild ginseng,</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.835" end="01:05:51.535" style="s2">delivery 3 days before your wager</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.435" end="01:05:53.035" style="s2">expires.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.535" end="01:05:54.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.035" end="01:05:59.035" style="s2">Last month, no new orders on anything</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.835" end="01:05:59.035" style="s2">else. Everything goes into this ginseng.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.535" end="01:06:05.435" style="s2">Mommy knows what she&#39;s doing. 3 million,</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.235" end="01:06:07.735" style="s2">exactly enough. Not one step can go</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.435" end="01:06:07.735" style="s2">wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.335" end="01:06:13.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re out of road.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.435" end="01:06:13.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have the same enemy.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.835" end="01:06:23.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You get 5 minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.435" end="01:06:33.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have proof.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.535" end="01:06:41.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa, bring me every report on Silver</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.035" end="01:06:41.235" style="s2">Creek Farm from this past year.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.335" end="01:06:49.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed, at this rate, Mrs. Hayes</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.735" end="01:06:49.635" style="s2">could actually win.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.935" end="01:06:55.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.135" end="01:06:56.935" style="s2">Wait till she&#39;s one step from the</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.435" end="01:06:59.935" style="s2">finish,</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.935" end="01:06:59.935" style="s2">then kick her down.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.935" end="01:07:08.335" style="s2">Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.635" end="01:07:08.335" style="s2">enjoy your last bit of happiness.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.835" end="01:07:16.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir?</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.035" end="01:07:19.135" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.935" end="01:07:22.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Visiting an old friend.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.135" end="01:07:23.436" style="s2">Elena, I&#39;ve regretted this whole year.</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.035" end="01:07:25.736" style="s2">Tear up the wager.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.436" end="01:07:27.836" style="s2">The company shares are off the table,</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.736" end="01:07:29.936" style="s2">but you get the house back,</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.836" end="01:07:32.436" style="s2">plus 500,000.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.936" end="01:07:34.136" style="s2">Sign off the bet today and you and Silas</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.436" end="01:07:36.336" style="s2">go home to a quiet life.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.136" end="01:07:37.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A year ago he smiled while he destroyed</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.336" end="01:07:42.036" style="s2">my home.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.836" end="01:07:42.036" style="s2">Now he smiles while he buys my life.</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.636" end="01:07:47.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a bad man.</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.136" end="01:07:52.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clayton, 7 days.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.036" end="01:07:52.036" style="s2">See you at the board meeting.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.036" end="01:07:59.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.536" end="01:08:01.436" style="s2">you think I came to surrender?</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.936" end="01:08:02.736" style="s2">I&#39;ve already mapped your entire farm</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.436" end="01:08:05.536" style="s2">with the most advanced surveillance</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.736" end="01:08:05.536" style="s2">drone there is.</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.736" end="01:08:09.936" style="s2">Stick to the plan. We move tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.536" end="01:08:20.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Warning, trespass detected. Cease all</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.736" end="01:08:22.636" style="s2">movement immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.136" end="01:08:26.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. The boss says these tin cans can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.636" end="01:08:28.636" style="s2">hurt humans. Get in close and jam them.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.897" end="01:08:32.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.636" end="01:08:32.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, they know our limits.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.036" end="01:08:59.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, come produce the text lost. Now</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.436" end="01:08:59.336" style="s2">check the damage.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.736" end="01:09:05.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This shipment&#39;s due to Blake Pharma in 3</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.336" end="01:09:05.836" style="s2">days.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.636" end="01:09:19.136" style="s2">The tank, the pipes filled with poison.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.336" end="01:09:20.636" style="s2">Not a drop is usable.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.136" end="01:09:22.236" style="s2">The well</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.636" end="01:09:23.636" style="s2">is gone too.</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.236" end="01:09:27.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 days.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.636" end="01:09:27.338" style="s2">How can anything grow in three days?</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.237" end="01:09:37.237" style="s2">There&#39;s still some green.</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.137" end="01:09:37.237" style="s2">That means there&#39;s hope.</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.438" end="01:09:44.438" style="s2">Three days.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.938" end="01:09:47.538" style="s2">We save what we can. I&#39;m calling right</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.438" end="01:09:50.538" style="s2">now. I&#39;ll ring every soul in this town.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.538" end="01:09:50.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll drive the water truck.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.038" end="01:10:04.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Farm defense captain reporting for duty.</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.338" end="01:10:07.137" style="s2">Reporting for duty.</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.738" end="01:10:08.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These hands flip pans. They don&#39;t haul</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.137" end="01:10:10.137" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.538" end="01:10:11.538" style="s2">Don&#39;t get me wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.137" end="01:10:12.738" style="s2">I just don&#39;t want my truffle menu cut</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.538" end="01:10:14.637" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.738" end="01:10:15.838" style="s2">Every Blue Ocean water truck answers to</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.637" end="01:10:18.338" style="s2">you today.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.838" end="01:10:18.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.938" end="01:10:27.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, I heard everything. A full batch</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.838" end="01:10:29.238" style="s2">of new seedlings is on the plane tonight</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.637" end="01:10:31.038" style="s2">at your farm by morning.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.238" end="01:10:33.338" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid. Blake Pharma stands</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.038" end="01:10:33.338" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.637" end="01:10:39.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, thank you. From now until</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.538" end="01:10:42.738" style="s2">delivery, every jug of serum goes to</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.438" end="01:10:42.738" style="s2">replanting this ginseng.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.637" end="01:10:47.838" style="s2">Not a drop held back.</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.738" end="01:10:50.038" style="s2">The small orders I promised you to, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.838" end="01:10:52.137" style="s2">sorry. They all have to wait.</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.038" end="01:10:53.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it waits. Save your ginseng. My</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.137" end="01:10:56.137" style="s2">guests can eat pasta for another week.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.838" end="01:10:58.038" style="s2">They&#39;ll live. Save your ginseng.</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.137" end="01:11:01.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone who slows down our ginseng</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.038" end="01:11:01.637" style="s2">answers to my rolling pin.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.338" end="01:11:15.538" style="s2">Sheriff, it&#39;s in your hands.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.637" end="01:11:15.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to look at the well.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.338" end="01:11:24.238" style="s2">Sheriff, we swept it before dawn.</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.338" end="01:11:26.338" style="s2">Nothing but blasting residue. That</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.238" end="01:11:27.939" style="s2">charge was lit by hand.</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.338" end="01:11:29.339" style="s2">Whoever lit it stood here at least 30</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.939" end="01:11:31.439" style="s2">seconds.</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.339" end="01:11:32.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Humbly Hayes, they don&#39;t leave anything</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.439" end="01:11:35.839" style="s2">behind.</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.939" end="01:11:35.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not necessarily.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.139" end="01:11:51.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water level&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.239" end="01:11:58.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; County Water Authority, routine water</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.239" end="01:12:00.939" style="s2">test.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.739" end="01:12:03.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sure. The tank&#39;s over there. Help</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.939" end="01:12:03.539" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.139" end="01:12:11.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water&#39;s fine. Sorry to bother you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.039" end="01:12:18.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mochi, I remember which way the truck</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.939" end="01:12:22.239" style="s2">went.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.739" end="01:12:22.239" style="s2">Those bad men will come back.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.139" end="01:12:27.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t bark.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.539" end="01:12:38.639" style="s2">It&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.839" end="01:12:38.639" style="s2">The water inspector from this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.039" end="01:12:47.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mary&#39;s as Xanaxed as things Wade. 1,200</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.639" end="01:12:49.139" style="s2">replanted today. Borrowing Lessing</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.239" end="01:12:51.439" style="s2">brand, Joe says at this rate by tomorrow</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.139" end="01:12:51.439" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.339" end="01:12:57.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silas, where were you?</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.339" end="01:12:59.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.239" end="01:13:01.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The water inspector left at this</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.239" end="01:13:01.739" style="s2">afternoon.</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.639" end="01:13:08.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I checked.</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.739" end="01:13:10.639" style="s2">The county sent nobody this month. The</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.739" end="01:13:12.039" style="s2">badge is fake.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.639" end="01:13:14.239" style="s2">The powder came back from the county lab</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.039" end="01:13:17.139" style="s2">half an hour ago. Concentrated plant</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.239" end="01:13:19.739" style="s2">poison. One spoon in a tank overnight</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.139" end="01:13:21.839" style="s2">rots every root.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.739" end="01:13:23.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So one man with a spoon in that tank</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.839" end="01:13:25.539" style="s2">wipes out every day of replanting.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.839" end="01:13:26.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what are we waiting for? Arrest</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.539" end="01:13:28.939" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.239" end="01:13:31.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase one off, another comes tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.939" end="01:13:33.340" style="s2">I don&#39;t want them gone.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.039" end="01:13:34.740" style="s2">I want the man behind them.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.340" end="01:13:37.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How?</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.740" end="01:13:38.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Set the trap and let them walk in.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.040" end="01:13:41.440" style="s2">Bradley, take two deputies and cover</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.940" end="01:13:43.340" style="s2">both sides of the ginseng field. Joe,</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.440" end="01:13:45.640" style="s2">take the crew and hold the tank.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.340" end="01:13:47.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. We&#39;ll seal the outer roads. Not</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.640" end="01:13:50.040" style="s2">even a rat gets out.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.640" end="01:13:51.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two, kill your lights, play dead,</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.040" end="01:13:52.940" style="s2">park in the barn. Don&#39;t move until I</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.840" end="01:13:54.740" style="s2">signal.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.940" end="01:13:55.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Copy. Entering silent mode.</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.740" end="01:13:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Acting</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.640" end="01:13:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can do that.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.040" end="01:14:06.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember him.</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.440" end="01:14:08.840" style="s2">Don&#39;t let go. He&#39;s got the man scent.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.640" end="01:14:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood, little officer.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.840" end="01:14:12.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a disaster. My expensive robots</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.040" end="01:14:15.361" style="s2">fried their circuits the night the well</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.440" end="01:14:15.540" style="s2">blew. Both down, unrepairable.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.361" end="01:14:17.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.540" end="01:14:20.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about tonight? Nobody&#39;s guarding</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.340" end="01:14:22.540" style="s2">the ginseng. I&#39;ll have to sit up alone.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.140" end="01:14:25.140" style="s2">One flashlight, one woman. Nothing else</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.540" end="01:14:27.640" style="s2">I can do.</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.140" end="01:14:31.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did the fish take the bait?</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.640" end="01:14:31.340" style="s2">Whoever he is, the word is out.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.140" end="01:14:44.440" style="s2">Clayton, you like to smile.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.940" end="01:14:44.440" style="s2">Tonight I wipe that smile off.</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.940" end="01:14:54.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman&#39;s asleep.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.440" end="01:14:57.340" style="s2">Where are the robots?</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.840" end="01:15:00.140" style="s2">The cafe said they&#39;re dead. Scrap metal.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.340" end="01:15:02.940" style="s2">Cut the talk. Done before dawn.</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.140" end="01:15:02.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Police, freeze.</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.940" end="01:15:14.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Restrained. No injuries.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.440" end="01:15:14.940" style="s2">Secured. The subject is crying.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.740" end="01:15:23.440" style="s2">Run from a dog.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.240" end="01:15:29.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it off.</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.640" end="01:15:29.540" style="s2">Deputy Triumph.</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.940" end="01:15:35.942" style="s2">Travis.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.740" end="01:15:37.142" style="s2">So you never really left.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.942" end="01:15:38.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hayes,</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.142" end="01:15:41.142" style="s2">this is a mistake.</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.742" end="01:15:43.642" style="s2">I I I I was just passing by. Saw someone</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.142" end="01:15:45.342" style="s2">jumped the wall. Came to look.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.642" end="01:15:47.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Passing by with a spray tank?</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.342" end="01:15:48.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They shoved it in my hands.</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.242" end="01:15:51.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I dug this phone out of the dirt by the</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.842" end="01:15:55.142" style="s2">blown well and now the Troutly Tomer.</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.242" end="01:15:55.142" style="s2">One number saved in it. Just one.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.842" end="01:15:58.852" style="s2">Elena, you still have his application,</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.642" end="01:15:58.942" style="s2">don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.852" end="01:16:00.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.942" end="01:16:01.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He left the day he applied.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.942" end="01:16:03.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.742" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">Travis Cole.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.042" end="01:16:07.542" style="s2">The number matches.</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.542" end="01:16:10.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not my phone.</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.542" end="01:16:10.442" style="s2">I don&#39;t know anything.</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.742" end="01:16:26.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the material destroyed? You&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.742" end="01:16:26.442" style="s2">every cent.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.542" end="01:16:29.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s it&#39;s all destroyed.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.327" end="01:16:32.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.242" end="01:16:34.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Take the money. Lay low. I&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.242" end="01:16:34.742" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.042" end="01:16:41.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clayton&#39;s voice, your answers, word for</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.842" end="01:16:43.242" style="s2">word, all recorded.</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.142" end="01:16:45.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll talk. All of it.</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.242" end="01:16:47.742" style="s2">Clayton forced me. The plets, the well,</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.542" end="01:16:49.342" style="s2">the poison, the tampering, all his</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.742" end="01:16:51.042" style="s2">orders.</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.342" end="01:16:52.642" style="s2">He paid me through a shell company.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.042" end="01:16:54.942" style="s2">Always when it&#39;s done, you get every</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.642" end="01:16:57.242" style="s2">cent. I have every record.</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.942" end="01:16:59.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Transfer dates. The day before the well,</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.242" end="01:17:01.142" style="s2">the night before the cafe.</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.642" end="01:17:02.342" style="s2">The chain closes.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.142" end="01:17:05.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clayton,</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.342" end="01:17:05.542" style="s2">this time I&#39;ve got your footprint.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.942" end="01:17:10.942" style="s2">I want to see Elena.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.942" end="01:17:17.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Thorn, the burner phone we dug up</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.742" end="01:17:20.342" style="s2">at the well</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.342" end="01:17:22.342" style="s2">was bought with your credit card.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.342" end="01:17:24.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I came to tell you how he played</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.342" end="01:17:26.442" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.242" end="01:17:27.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rachel, I&#39;ll get your farm back.</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.442" end="01:17:29.242" style="s2">Transferring the title needs a card for</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.842" end="01:17:30.542" style="s2">the deposit. Give me the card. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.242" end="01:17:32.542" style="s2">handle the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.542" end="01:17:35.042" style="s2">You don&#39;t need the details. Once Elena</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.542" end="01:17:37.543" style="s2">falls, Thorn Valley is yours. Just wait</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.042" end="01:17:37.543" style="s2">for word.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.243" end="01:17:43.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought he was my last way out.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.443" end="01:17:45.543" style="s2">I was just a card he hadn&#39;t maxed out</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.343" end="01:17:48.243" style="s2">and a ready-made scapegoat.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.543" end="01:17:50.243" style="s2">Elena, I&#39;m sorry. I set you up, smeared</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.243" end="01:17:52.043" style="s2">you, lied to everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.243" end="01:17:54.143" style="s2">I&#39;m not asking forgiveness. Take these</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.043" end="01:17:55.943" style="s2">recordings. I&#39;ll testify. Rachel, I</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.143" end="01:17:59.243" style="s2">accept your apology.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.943" end="01:18:01.943" style="s2">Forgiveness depends on what you do next.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.243" end="01:18:01.943" style="s2">I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.443" end="01:18:05.243" style="s2">Bradley, this is the USB drive my</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.843" end="01:18:06.443" style="s2">husband left.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.243" end="01:18:08.543" style="s2">I think there&#39;s something crucial on it</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.443" end="01:18:09.843" style="s2">about the case.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.543" end="01:18:12.943" style="s2">Can you break into it?</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.843" end="01:18:12.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. I&#39;ll get on it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.443" end="01:18:17.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.543" end="01:18:19.343" style="s2">Blake&#39;s inspector just measured the</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.543" end="01:18:20.643" style="s2">seedlings. They&#39;re growing three times</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.343" end="01:18:22.843" style="s2">normal speed,</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.643" end="01:18:25.943" style="s2">but they&#39;re still short of the line.</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.843" end="01:18:25.943" style="s2">And delivery is tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.043" end="01:18:35.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last jug.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.343" end="01:18:35.643" style="s2">Delivery at dawn. Not a drop wasted.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.443" end="01:18:41.843" style="s2">Quiet, everyone. Don&#39;t spook the</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.243" end="01:18:41.843" style="s2">ginseng.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.943" end="01:18:53.243" style="s2">Please, just a little more.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.643" end="01:18:53.243" style="s2">A little more.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.979" end="01:19:02.543" style="s2">[gasps] The berries are red, red.</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.743" end="01:19:09.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long rhizome, dense roots.</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.743" end="01:19:09.043" style="s2">Better than the batch we lost.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.114" end="01:19:13.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.043" end="01:19:13.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe, crate them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.943" end="01:19:23.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Re-test results. Saponins, residue,</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.943" end="01:19:25.243" style="s2">heavy metals all pass. Purity is even</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.443" end="01:19:28.043" style="s2">higher than the last batch.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.243" end="01:19:31.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Accepted. Elena, $3 million.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.043" end="01:19:31.043" style="s2">Blake Pharma pays now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.074" end="01:19:35.043" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.343" end="01:19:36.443" style="s2">Congratulations, Mrs. Hayes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.043" end="01:19:37.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.443" end="01:19:38.045" style="s2">It&#39;s not time to celebrate.</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.843" end="01:19:39.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.045" end="01:19:40.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the lawyer I recommended, Grace</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.644" end="01:19:43.144" style="s2">Holloway.</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.545" end="01:19:45.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hayes, I&#39;ve read your file. Every</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.144" end="01:19:47.744" style="s2">piece of it puts Clayton away for years.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.744" end="01:19:50.144" style="s2">When do you want to hand it to the FBI?</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.744" end="01:19:50.144" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.644" end="01:19:56.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, three days left on the wager.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.144" end="01:19:58.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Travis reported the materials destroyed.</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.144" end="01:20:01.144" style="s2">No delivery, Blake turns on her.</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.144" end="01:20:01.144" style="s2">In three days, she&#39;s nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.545" end="01:20:10.445" style="s2">Mr. Reed, a woman just walked into the</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.545" end="01:20:10.445" style="s2">FBI with a stack of files on you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.144" end="01:20:16.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, I made some calls.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.844" end="01:20:19.445" style="s2">The FBI&#39;s Financial Crimes Unit has the</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.644" end="01:20:21.644" style="s2">file, but opening a case takes time. Two</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.445" end="01:20:23.144" style="s2">weeks at best.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.644" end="01:20:25.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two weeks?</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.144" end="01:20:27.644" style="s2">I don&#39;t need two weeks. I need three</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.545" end="01:20:29.045" style="s2">days.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.644" end="01:20:30.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed, it&#39;s late.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.045" end="01:20:32.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Draft an emergency motion. File it</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.844" end="01:20:34.144" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.045" end="01:20:36.545" style="s2">Sue Elena Hayes for running the farm on</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.144" end="01:20:37.945" style="s2">Liam&#39;s company funds. Embezzlement.</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.545" end="01:20:39.144" style="s2">Freeze every account she has until the</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.945" end="01:20:40.844" style="s2">investigation closes.</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.144" end="01:20:41.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evidence? We have nothing on her startup</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.844" end="01:20:42.644" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.244" end="01:20:44.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dig out the Hayes and Reed internal</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.644" end="01:20:46.144" style="s2">disbursement records. Fill in what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.244" end="01:20:47.844" style="s2">missing. Adjust what needs adjusting.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.144" end="01:20:48.844" style="s2">You&#39;re a lawyer. Your job is to make the</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.844" end="01:20:50.744" style="s2">judge believe.</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.844" end="01:20:51.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.744" end="01:20:54.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freeze the accounts and she can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.945" end="01:20:56.244" style="s2">produce one valid statement. Her audit</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.144" end="01:20:58.445" style="s2">becomes waste paper. When the clock runs</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.244" end="01:20:59.545" style="s2">out, she loses anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.445" end="01:21:00.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So she delivered.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.545" end="01:21:02.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what?</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.844" end="01:21:04.445" style="s2">This bet was never about who grows</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.045" end="01:21:04.445" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.945" end="01:21:10.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million in the bank. Nobody leaves</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.045" end="01:21:11.644" style="s2">until 50 skewers are gone.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.244" end="01:21:12.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The streamers are interfering with my</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.644" end="01:21:13.545" style="s2">sensors.</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.344" end="01:21:14.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you dare take them off. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.545" end="01:21:17.186" style="s2">celebration gear.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.545" end="01:21:18.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think it looks good.</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.186" end="01:21:21.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.545" end="01:21:23.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, one each.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.744" end="01:21:25.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two days to the board meeting. Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.744" end="01:21:28.445" style="s2">are you nervous?</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.144" end="01:21:28.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was. Not anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.344" end="01:21:32.344" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.045" end="01:21:34.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hayes, this is the manager at</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.344" end="01:21:35.545" style="s2">Silver Creek Union Bank. Under an</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.045" end="01:21:37.144" style="s2">emergency freeze order issued by the</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.545" end="01:21:38.344" style="s2">state court this morning, all your</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.144" end="01:21:39.945" style="s2">personal and business accounts are</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.344" end="01:21:41.845" style="s2">frozen, effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.945" end="01:21:43.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What freeze order? Who filed it?</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.845" end="01:21:46.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re not authorized to disclose the</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.046" end="01:21:47.446" style="s2">applicant. Please contact the court.</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.006" end="01:21:50.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.446" end="01:21:51.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is the accounts? All frozen. Then</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.146" end="01:21:53.646" style="s2">the audit?</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.345" end="01:21:56.845" style="s2">The statements?</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.646" end="01:21:56.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, it&#39;s Clayton.</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.245" end="01:22:00.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two days left.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.946" end="01:22:07.046" style="s2">I just came from court. Emergency</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.546" end="01:22:09.546" style="s2">hearing granted. 9:00 tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.046" end="01:22:11.345" style="s2">Thank God. We have three things. The</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.546" end="01:22:13.046" style="s2">independent audit, Travis&#39;s transfer</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.345" end="01:22:15.146" style="s2">records, and that recording.</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.046" end="01:22:16.946" style="s2">Elena, tomorrow you don&#39;t say a word.</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.146" end="01:22:17.745" style="s2">Just sit there.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.946" end="01:22:19.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.745" end="01:22:21.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Court is in session.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.446" end="01:22:23.345" style="s2">Mr. Pearce, proceed.</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.345" end="01:22:25.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Honor, five transfer receipts</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.345" end="01:22:27.046" style="s2">showing the defendant&#39;s farm was funded</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.046" end="01:22:29.146" style="s2">from Liam Hayes&#39;s company accounts. We</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.046" end="01:22:30.546" style="s2">contend this is embezzlement and move to</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.146" end="01:22:34.046" style="s2">freeze all her accounts pending</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.546" end="01:22:35.546" style="s2">investigation. Ms. Holloway.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.046" end="01:22:37.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Honor, first we submit an</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.546" end="01:22:41.345" style="s2">independent audit from Sterling Hale, a</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.546" end="01:22:41.345" style="s2">firm with no ties to either party.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.682" end="01:22:44.646" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.745" end="01:22:46.745" style="s2">As for their transfer receipts, Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.646" end="01:22:48.146" style="s2">Pearce, tell the court what date is on</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.745" end="01:22:49.745" style="s2">the third receipt.</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.146" end="01:22:51.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The 15th of last month.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.745" end="01:22:55.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was a Sunday. The bank doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.646" end="01:22:55.745" style="s2">process corporate transfers on Sundays.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.046" end="01:22:59.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Possibly system delay.</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.245" end="01:23:01.646" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t affect authenticity.</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.745" end="01:23:02.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe. Then let me play one more</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.646" end="01:23:05.046" style="s2">recording for the court.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.946" end="01:23:07.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the material destroyed? You&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.046" end="01:23:09.946" style="s2">every cent. It&#39;s It&#39;s all destroyed.</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.646" end="01:23:12.546" style="s2">Good. Take the money, lay low. I &#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.946" end="01:23:12.546" style="s2">call tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.046" end="01:23:16.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a call from a few days ago in</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.946" end="01:23:18.845" style="s2">which Clayton Reed personally ordered</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.845" end="01:23:20.745" style="s2">the destruction of Silver Creek&#39;s well</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.845" end="01:23:22.345" style="s2">and the poisoning of its crops. The</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.745" end="01:23:25.146" style="s2">payments to Travis Cole came from</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.345" end="01:23:27.745" style="s2">Pinecrest Consulting LLC, a shell</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.146" end="01:23:29.245" style="s2">company controlled by Clayton Reed.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.745" end="01:23:31.345" style="s2">Your Honor, the plaintiff&#39;s motion isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.245" end="01:23:33.946" style="s2">about the truth. It&#39;s about freezing</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.345" end="01:23:37.245" style="s2">every cent the defendant has in the last</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.946" end="01:23:37.245" style="s2">three days of her wager.</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.345" end="01:23:41.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Pearce, your client ordered the</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.245" end="01:23:43.046" style="s2">destruction of the defendant&#39;s property</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.245" end="01:23:44.547" style="s2">and filed what appear to be forged</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.046" end="01:23:46.147" style="s2">receipts with this court?</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.547" end="01:23:46.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your honor, my my client had no</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.147" end="01:23:48.747" style="s2">knowledge.</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.647" end="01:23:51.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. This court vacates the freeze</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.747" end="01:23:55.047" style="s2">order immediately. The bank will restore</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.147" end="01:23:55.047" style="s2">all of the defendant&#39;s accounts today.</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.747" end="01:23:59.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed,</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.147" end="01:24:01.147" style="s2">the freeze is vacated</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.147" end="01:24:03.547" style="s2">and the judge warned me the receipts go</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.147" end="01:24:05.447" style="s2">to forensics.</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.547" end="01:24:08.047" style="s2">I I I could lose my license.</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.447" end="01:24:08.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.147" end="01:24:16.247" style="s2">Security chief?</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.147" end="01:24:17.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Reed.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.247" end="01:24:19.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.347" end="01:24:21.547" style="s2">that woman does not set one foot in this</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.147" end="01:24:21.547" style="s2">building.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.847" end="01:24:29.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A year ago, the woman in the mirror wore</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.747" end="01:24:32.747" style="s2">black and did nothing but cry.</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.747" end="01:24:32.747" style="s2">Lena Hayes run those</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.347" end="01:24:36.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, run!</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.847" end="01:24:43.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.147" end="01:24:43.747" style="s2">go take back everything that&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.547" end="01:24:52.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone who blocks our Elena today gets</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.647" end="01:24:52.247" style="s2">my rolling pin on the head.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.847" end="01:24:59.947" style="s2">The original audit, court certified.</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.147" end="01:25:02.347" style="s2">Walk through that door and this is all</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.947" end="01:25:02.347" style="s2">you need.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.647" end="01:25:09.147" style="s2">Go get back what&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.147" end="01:25:13.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.147" end="01:25:13.047" style="s2">I&#39;ll clear the way. Every light green.</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.347" end="01:25:16.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silas, you&#39;ve got this.</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.947" end="01:25:40.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a board meeting.</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.547" end="01:25:40.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, Mrs. Hayes. You can&#39;t go in.</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.547" end="01:25:45.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t move, I&#39;ll make a scene.</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.247" end="01:25:48.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m following the bylaws, ma&#39;am. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.948" end="01:25:48.749" style="s2">not going in today.</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.749" end="01:25:58.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hayes is the lawful heir of Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.849" end="01:26:01.049" style="s2">Liam Hayes&#39;s estate. Under Article 17,</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.849" end="01:26:03.149" style="s2">the heir may attend board meetings.</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.049" end="01:26:04.549" style="s2">Blocking her violates the bylaws.</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.149" end="01:26:07.149" style="s2">Whoever blocks her carries the</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.549" end="01:26:07.149" style="s2">liability.</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.249" end="01:26:10.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Mr. Reed</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.749" end="01:26:12.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed&#39;s orders are smaller than the</p>
<p begin="01:26:10.448" end="01:26:16.049" style="s2">bylaws and smaller than the law. Do you</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.849" end="01:26:16.049" style="s2">want to go to prison for them?</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.149" end="01:26:20.649" style="s2">Mrs. Hayes, follow me.</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.649" end="01:26:24.849" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, I&#39;ve waited for you every day</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.249" end="01:26:25.749" style="s2">this year.</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.849" end="01:26:27.749" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.749" end="01:26:30.448" style="s2">The day Mr. Liam died, I knew Clayton</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.749" end="01:26:33.349" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t spare you and the boy.</p>
<p begin="01:26:30.448" end="01:26:36.249" style="s2">But I&#39;m only a secretary.</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.349" end="01:26:36.249" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t do a thing.</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.448" end="01:26:43.549" style="s2">If Liam could see today,</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.049" end="01:26:43.549" style="s2">he&#39;d be so proud of you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.749" end="01:26:47.849" style="s2">Thank you, Miss Shaw.</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.549" end="01:26:47.849" style="s2">Shaw.</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.349" end="01:26:55.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, today is the final day of the</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.849" end="01:26:57.649" style="s2">wager.</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.849" end="01:26:59.849" style="s2">Per the agreement,</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.649" end="01:27:04.249" style="s2">Elena Hayes must appear in this room</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.849" end="01:27:04.249" style="s2">today with a qualifying audit.</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.149" end="01:27:09.049" style="s2">It is now 10:02 a.m.</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.549" end="01:27:12.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hayes isn&#39;t coming?</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.149" end="01:27:14.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heard her accounts are frozen. Of course</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.849" end="01:27:16.149" style="s2">she&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.549" end="01:27:18.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a shame.</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.149" end="01:27:21.948" style="s2">Liam was my dearest friend. How I hoped</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.549" end="01:27:21.948" style="s2">his widow would make a miracle.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.448" end="01:27:26.448" style="s2">But rules are rules.</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.149" end="01:27:29.249" style="s2">Since the other party has failed to</p>
<p begin="01:27:26.448" end="01:27:31.749" style="s2">appear, I assume all of Liam&#39;s shares as</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.249" end="01:27:31.749" style="s2">agreed.</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.349" end="01:27:38.349" style="s2">So now we proceed to</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.349" end="01:27:42.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The meeting can start now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.249" end="01:27:46.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you get in?</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.225" end="01:27:53.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.149" end="01:27:53.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clayton, here&#39;s what asked for.</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.150" end="01:28:00.150" style="s2">Everyone,</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.350" end="01:28:02.950" style="s2">I&#39;m Elena Hayes, Liam Hayes&#39;s widow, and</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.150" end="01:28:05.150" style="s2">I&#39;m here on time.</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.950" end="01:28:07.150" style="s2">Company auditor, verify the bank</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.150" end="01:28:08.450" style="s2">statements now.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.150" end="01:28:11.350" style="s2">Auditor,</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.450" end="01:28:11.350" style="s2">that&#39;s your job.</p>
<p begin="01:28:14.550" end="01:28:19.550" style="s2">Directors, verification complete.</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.650" end="01:28:22.050" style="s2">Silver Creek Farms net profit for the</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.550" end="01:28:24.550" style="s2">year, $11 million,</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.050" end="01:28:25.750" style="s2">1 million above the target.</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.550" end="01:28:28.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 11 million?</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.750" end="01:28:30.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She actually did it in one year?</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.350" end="01:28:32.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.350" end="01:28:34.650" style="s2">This is impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.250" end="01:28:36.750" style="s2">She cheated. She has glowing magic</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.650" end="01:28:39.450" style="s2">water, and those two robots aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.750" end="01:28:39.450" style="s2">man-made.</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.050" end="01:28:42.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Magic water?</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.650" end="01:28:46.750" style="s2">Has he lost his mind?</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.950" end="01:28:48.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pressure this year, it broke him.</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.750" end="01:28:49.450" style="s2">You don&#39;t believe me? I saw it with my</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.550" end="01:28:51.450" style="s2">own eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.450" end="01:28:53.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clayton, that magic water you keep</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.450" end="01:28:54.250" style="s2">talking about, we do have it on the</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.350" end="01:28:57.150" style="s2">farm.</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.250" end="01:28:57.150" style="s2">It&#39;s called hard work.</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.150" end="01:29:06.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, order. We now vote on the</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.450" end="01:29:10.050" style="s2">disposition of all assets and shares</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.550" end="01:29:10.050" style="s2">held by Mr. Liam Hayes.</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.250" end="01:29:14.550" style="s2">All in favor of returning Liam Hayes&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.250" end="01:29:18.350" style="s2">assets and shares to his lawful heir,</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.550" end="01:29:18.350" style="s2">Elena Hayes, raise your hands.</p>
<p begin="01:29:19.150" end="01:29:23.350" style="s2">Unanimous.</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.550" end="01:29:26.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, we won.</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.350" end="01:29:26.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, we won.</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.050" end="01:29:34.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clayton Reed, you&#39;re under arrest for</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.550" end="01:29:36.550" style="s2">commercial fraud, embezzlement, and</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.450" end="01:29:39.050" style="s2">inciting the destruction of property.</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.550" end="01:29:39.050" style="s2">Come with us.</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.750" end="01:29:46.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a conspiracy. SHE SET IT UP.</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.550" end="01:29:48.750" style="s2">DON&#39;T BELIEVE HER. The USB drive, those</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.150" end="01:29:52.451" style="s2">recordings, all forged.</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.750" end="01:29:52.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed, save it for cord.</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.052" end="01:30:04.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silas&#39;s name, his birthday, our</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.851" end="01:30:06.052" style="s2">anniversary, I tried dozens.</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.751" end="01:30:08.451" style="s2">I never thought it would be that one</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.052" end="01:30:08.451" style="s2">line.</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.222" end="01:30:20.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.851" end="01:30:32.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.651" end="01:30:35.251" style="s2">Silas, if you&#39;re watching this,</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.552" end="01:30:35.251" style="s2">then I&#39;m gone.</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.351" end="01:30:38.151" style="s2">I found out Clayton was skimming company</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.151" end="01:30:40.751" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.151" end="01:30:42.451" style="s2">Not small amounts. I kept quiet and</p>
<p begin="01:30:40.751" end="01:30:44.151" style="s2">gathered evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.451" end="01:30:46.387" style="s2">What&#39;s on this drive is the last</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.151" end="01:30:47.651" style="s2">protection I can give you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.387" end="01:30:50.751" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.651" end="01:30:54.052" style="s2">Elena, one more thing. Silver Creek Farm</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.751" end="01:30:57.151" style="s2">is the old place my grandmother left me.</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.052" end="01:30:59.052" style="s2">I spent every summer there as a boy.</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.151" end="01:31:00.951" style="s2">The soil looks dead,</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.052" end="01:31:03.351" style="s2">but it will grow anything. If you ever</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.951" end="01:31:06.651" style="s2">run out of options, don&#39;t be afraid.</p>
<p begin="01:31:03.351" end="01:31:06.651" style="s2">That&#39;s the road home I left you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.693" end="01:31:08.951" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.552" end="01:31:11.351" style="s2">Silas,</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.951" end="01:31:12.851" style="s2">whatever happens, be brave and say it</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.351" end="01:31:14.351" style="s2">out loud.</p>
<p begin="01:31:12.851" end="01:31:16.951" style="s2">Daddy loves you</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.351" end="01:31:16.951" style="s2">always.</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.103" end="01:31:23.123" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:31:25.151" end="01:31:27.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.651" end="01:31:32.893" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.052" end="01:31:34.913" style="s2">Mommy&#39;s right here.</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.893" end="01:31:34.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.151" end="01:31:43.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go, Mr. Reed.</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.351" end="01:31:52.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s name is back.</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.151" end="01:31:54.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.251" end="01:31:54.952" style="s2">It&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.093" end="01:32:04.988" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.653" end="01:32:06.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling. My god. I knew you&#39;d do it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.988" end="01:32:08.952" style="s2">[laughter and gasps] I&#39;ve thought about</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.153" end="01:32:10.452" style="s2">you every single day this year.</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.952" end="01:32:12.752" style="s2">I wanted to stay with you at the</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.452" end="01:32:15.352" style="s2">funeral, but my little one had a fever.</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.752" end="01:32:17.952" style="s2">I simply couldn&#39;t get away. Next month&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:15.352" end="01:32:20.252" style="s2">charity gala, the head table is yours.</p>
<p begin="01:32:17.952" end="01:32:21.364" style="s2">Our yacht. Take it out whenever you</p>
<p begin="01:32:20.252" end="01:32:23.452" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.364" end="01:32:26.952" style="s2">[laughter] Elena, you&#39;re back on the</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.452" end="01:32:29.933" style="s2">list. Let me sponsor you. Sisters, heart</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.952" end="01:32:29.933" style="s2">and soul. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.352" end="01:32:36.552" style="s2">All of it feels so familiar</p>
<p begin="01:32:33.352" end="01:32:36.552" style="s2">and so strange.</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.252" end="01:32:43.952" style="s2">Still awake?</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.252" end="01:32:48.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, when are we going home?</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.952" end="01:32:54.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby, this is</p>
<p begin="01:32:53.252" end="01:32:56.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not here</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.552" end="01:32:58.252" style="s2">where the oak trees are</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.352" end="01:33:00.852" style="s2">where Layla is</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.252" end="01:33:03.653" style="s2">and Rusty.</p>
<p begin="01:33:00.852" end="01:33:03.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we go home.</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.452" end="01:33:16.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re finally back. I watered your</p>
<p begin="01:33:14.452" end="01:33:18.952" style="s2">sunflowers every single day, not one</p>
<p begin="01:33:16.452" end="01:33:18.952" style="s2">missed.</p>
<p begin="01:33:20.252" end="01:33:27.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, we missed you so much.</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.252" end="01:33:27.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home, master.</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.952" end="01:33:35.252" style="s2">My work</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.352" end="01:33:37.052" style="s2">isn&#39;t great.</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.252" end="01:33:40.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful, prettier than any</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.052" end="01:33:40.352" style="s2">gold-plated sign.</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.653" end="01:33:44.552" style="s2">1 2 3 HANG IT.</p>
<p begin="01:33:48.852" end="01:33:53.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SILAS, IS THIS THE ONE YOU PLANTED?</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.252" end="01:33:57.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The seeds from daddy&#39;s suitcase. I grew</p>
<p begin="01:33:53.552" end="01:33:57.954" style="s2">it myself. Not one drop the serum.</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.754" end="01:34:19.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So noisy. How many times did you wake me</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.854" end="01:34:21.054" style="s2">this year?</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.354" end="01:34:22.154" style="s2">Don&#39;t just stand there. Make the last</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.054" end="01:34:24.754" style="s2">wish.</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.154" end="01:34:26.654" style="s2">I want to go back to sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.754" end="01:34:30.254" style="s2">Obviously, don&#39;t dawdle.</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.654" end="01:34:30.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you rushing me?</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.400" end="01:34:31.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.954" end="01:34:34.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen,</p>
<p begin="01:34:31.954" end="01:34:36.154" style="s2">friends and family price.</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.054" end="01:34:38.954" style="s2">Just say it and I&#39;ll let you grow the</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.154" end="01:34:40.654" style="s2">most expensive crop on earth. In three</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.954" end="01:34:44.554" style="s2">years, you&#39;ll be the richest person</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.654" end="01:34:48.154" style="s2">alive. Well, tempted?</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.554" end="01:34:48.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already got back what Liam left.</p>
<p begin="01:34:49.654" end="01:34:54.454" style="s2">And I found something worth</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.754" end="01:34:56.254" style="s2">a Silas who talks and laughs and friends</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.454" end="01:34:58.854" style="s2">who drive a pickup at midnight just to</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.254" end="01:34:58.854" style="s2">bring water.</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.154" end="01:35:04.054" style="s2">I&#39;m sure</p>
<p begin="01:35:00.454" end="01:35:04.054" style="s2">the rest of the road I&#39;ll walk myself.</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.654" end="01:35:09.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are the dumbest master I&#39;ve ever</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.454" end="01:35:11.554" style="s2">had.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.654" end="01:35:13.654" style="s2">Turning down the richest person alive,</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.554" end="01:35:16.654" style="s2">insisting on watering drop by drop,</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.654" end="01:35:16.654" style="s2">completely dumb.</p>
<p begin="01:35:20.354" end="01:35:25.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:22.454" end="01:35:25.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goodbye, Genie.</p>
<p begin="01:35:33.454" end="01:35:37.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time you grew it yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.954" end="01:35:41.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too.</p>
<p begin="01:35:39.854" end="01:35:44.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, master. The Genie didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:35:41.854" end="01:35:46.354" style="s2">take us back. We&#39;re not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.654" end="01:35:48.346" style="s2">We still have to drive the young master</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.354" end="01:35:50.311" style="s2">to school.</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.346" end="01:35:52.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.311" end="01:35:52.331" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.154" end="01:36:03.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.156" end="01:36:06.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is plain water.</p>
<p begin="01:36:03.856" end="01:36:06.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm, I know.</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.306" end="01:36:11.326" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.955" end="01:36:17.156" style="s2">Daddy, look. The flowers we grew are</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.455" end="01:36:17.156" style="s2">blooming.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
